"[{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDODrKopQ\",\"login\":\"2005buinguyenchihau-alt\",\"name\":\"\",\"databaseId\":246589605}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nBiﾃｪn so蘯｡n Bﾃ｡o cﾃ｡o ki盻ノ th盻ｭ t盻貧g k蘯ｿt cu盻訴 k盻ｳ (Final Test Summary Report) vﾃ Ch盻ｩng ch盻・ﾄ黛ｺ｣m b蘯｣o ch蘯･t lﾆｰ盻｣ng ph蘯ｧn m盻［.\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] T盻貧g h盻｣p toﾃn b盻・k蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ ki盻ノ th盻ｭ t盻ｫ Tu蘯ｧn 1 ﾄ黛ｺｿn Tu蘯ｧn 8: S盻・test cases thi蘯ｿt k蘯ｿ, s盻・lﾆｰ盻｣t test run, s盻・bug ﾄ妥｣ fix.\\n- [ ] Bﾃ｡o cﾃ｡o ma tr蘯ｭn bao ph盻ｧ ki盻ノ th盻ｭ: 100% cﾃ｡c Use Case ﾄ黛ｻ「 cﾃｳ ﾃｭt nh蘯･t 2 test cases ki盻ノ ch盻ｩng.\\n- [ ] ﾄ静｡nh giﾃ｡ m盻ｩc ﾄ黛ｻ・s蘯ｵn sﾃng tri盻ハ khai th盻ｱc t蘯ｿ (Production Readiness) c盻ｧa h盻・th盻創g EVManager.\\n- [ ] Kﾃｽ biﾃｪn b蘯｣n nghi盻㍊ thu ch蘯･t lﾆｰ盻｣ng ph蘯ｧn m盻［ cﾃｹng PM Hoﾃng ﾄ黛ｻ・n盻冪 H盻冓 ﾄ黛ｻ渡g ch蘯･m ﾄ黛ｻ・ﾃ｡n.\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- T蘯ｭp Bﾃ｡o cﾃ｡o ki盻ノ th盻ｭ hoﾃn ch盻穎h `docs/testing/Final_Test_Report_EVManager.pdf`.\\n- Bﾃn giao toﾃn b盻・tﾃi li盻㎡ ki盻ノ th盻ｭ cho PM ﾄ妥ｳng d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n.\\n\\n**Deadline:** 01/11/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm3Xg\",\"name\":\"type: docs\",\"description\":\"Tﾃi li盻㎡ d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n\",\"color\":\"e4e669\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6kw\",\"name\":\"owner: hau\",\"description\":\"H蘯ｭu (Database \u0026 QA/Tester)\",\"color\":\"c5def5\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":156,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[DB/QA] QA-25: Biﾃｪn so蘯｡n Bﾃ｡o cﾃ｡o ki盻ノ th盻ｭ t盻貧g k蘯ｿt cu盻訴 k盻ｳ (Final Test Report) vﾃ Biﾃｪn b蘯｣n nghi盻㍊ thu ch蘯･t lﾆｰ盻｣ng\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDODrKopQ\",\"login\":\"2005buinguyenchihau-alt\",\"name\":\"\",\"databaseId\":246589605}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nQu蘯｣n lﾃｽ vﾃ th盻ｱc hi盻㌻ ﾄ妥ｳng toﾃn b盻・cﾃ｡c Defect trong Defect Log sau khi ki盻ノ tra ﾄ黛ｺ｡t yﾃｪu c蘯ｧu.\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] Ki盻ノ tra l蘯｡i t盻ｫng ticket l盻擁 trﾃｪn GitHub Issues: Xﾃ｡c nh蘯ｭn code ﾄ妥｣ s盻ｭa, ﾄ妥｣ test pass trﾃｪn mﾃｴi trﾆｰ盻拵g Staging.\\n- [ ] Vi蘯ｿt comment t盻貧g k蘯ｿt trﾃｪn t盻ｫng issue l盻擁 ghi rﾃｵ: \u0027ﾄ静｣ re-test thﾃnh cﾃｴng, l盻擁 khﾃｴng cﾃｲn tﾃ｡i hi盻㌻\u0027.\\n- [ ] ﾄ雪ｻ品 nhﾃ｣n t盻ｫ `type: bug` sang tr蘯｡ng thﾃ｡i ﾄ妥ｳng (Closed).\\n- [ ] ﾄ雪ｺ｣m b蘯｣o trong Defect Log khﾃｴng cﾃｲn b蘯･t k盻ｳ l盻擁 nﾃo 盻・m盻ｩc Critical ho蘯ｷc High chﾆｰa gi蘯｣i quy蘯ｿt.\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- 100% ticket l盻擁 trﾃｪn GitHub ﾄ柁ｰ盻｣c ﾄ妥ｳng v盻嬖 ﾄ黛ｺｧy ﾄ黛ｻｧ b蘯ｱng ch盻ｩng re-test.\\n- B蘯｣ng t盻貧g k蘯ｿt Defect Log hoﾃn ch盻穎h `docs/testing/defect-log-final.md`.\\n\\n**Deadline:** 25/10/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm3ug\",\"name\":\"type: test\",\"description\":\"Test case vﾃ bﾃ｡o cﾃ｡o ki盻ノ th盻ｭ\",\"color\":\"0e8a16\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6kw\",\"name\":\"owner: hau\",\"description\":\"H蘯ｭu (Database \u0026 QA/Tester)\",\"color\":\"c5def5\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":155,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[DB/QA] QA-24: Qu蘯｣n lﾃｽ vﾃ ﾄ妥ｳng cﾃ｡c Defect trong Defect Log sau khi ki盻ノ tra ﾄ黛ｺ｡t yﾃｪu c蘯ｧu\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDODrKopQ\",\"login\":\"2005buinguyenchihau-alt\",\"name\":\"\",\"databaseId\":246589605}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nPh盻訴 h盻｣p v盻嬖 BA t盻・ch盻ｩc phiﾃｪn ki盻ノ th盻ｭ ch蘯･p nh蘯ｭn ngﾆｰ盻拱 dﾃｹng (UAT Execution) vﾃ ghi nh蘯ｭn ph蘯｣n h盻妬 th盻ｱc t蘯ｿ.\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] Chu蘯ｩn b盻・tﾃi kho蘯｣n vﾃ mﾃｴi trﾆｰ盻拵g UAT riﾃｪng bi盻㏄ khﾃｴng lﾃm 蘯｣nh hﾆｰ盻殤g d盻ｯ li盻㎡ th蘯ｭt.\\n- [ ] Hﾆｰ盻嬾g d蘯ｫn khﾃ｡ch hﾃng/ngﾆｰ盻拱 dﾃｹng th盻ｭ nghi盻㍊ th盻ｱc hi盻㌻ tu蘯ｧn t盻ｱ 15 k盻議h b蘯｣n UAT.\\n- [ ] H盻・tr盻｣ ngﾆｰ盻拱 dﾃｹng khi g蘯ｷp khﾃｳ khﾄハ vﾃ ghi nh蘯ｭn toﾃn b盻・cﾃ｡c ﾃｽ ki蘯ｿn ﾄ妥ｳng gﾃｳp v盻・giao di盻㌻.\\n- [ ] T盻貧g h盻｣p b蘯｣ng k蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ ﾄ妥｡nh giﾃ｡ UAT: 15/15 k盻議h b蘯｣n ﾄ柁ｰ盻｣c khﾃ｡ch hﾃng ch蘯･p thu蘯ｭn.\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- Biﾃｪn b蘯｣n ghi nh蘯ｭn k蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ UAT lﾆｰu t蘯｡i `docs/testing/uat-execution-results.md`.\\n- Bﾃn giao h盻・sﾆ｡ UAT cho PM lﾃm th盻ｧ t盻･c nghi盻㍊ thu.\\n\\n**Deadline:** 25/10/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm3ug\",\"name\":\"type: test\",\"description\":\"Test case vﾃ bﾃ｡o cﾃ｡o ki盻ノ th盻ｭ\",\"color\":\"0e8a16\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6kw\",\"name\":\"owner: hau\",\"description\":\"H蘯ｭu (Database \u0026 QA/Tester)\",\"color\":\"c5def5\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":154,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[DB/QA] QA-23: Ph盻訴 h盻｣p v盻嬖 BA t盻・ch盻ｩc phiﾃｪn ki盻ノ th盻ｭ ch蘯･p nh蘯ｭn ngﾆｰ盻拱 dﾃｹng (UAT Execution)\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDODrKopQ\",\"login\":\"2005buinguyenchihau-alt\",\"name\":\"\",\"databaseId\":246589605}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nKi盻ノ th盻ｭ hi盻㎡ nﾄハg h盻・th盻創g: ﾄ塵 th盻拱 gian t蘯｣i trang (\u003c 3 giﾃ｢y) vﾃ kh蘯｣ nﾄハg ph蘯｣n h盻妬 c盻ｧa API theo tiﾃｪu chu蘯ｩn ch蘯･p nh蘯ｭn.\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] S盻ｭ d盻･ng cﾃｴng c盻･ Apache JMeter ho蘯ｷc k6 ﾄ黛ｻ・gi蘯｣ l蘯ｭp 50 ngﾆｰ盻拱 dﾃｹng g盻ｭi request ﾄ黛ｻ渡g th盻拱 vﾃo h盻・th盻創g.\\n- [ ] ﾄ塵 th盻拱 gian ph蘯｣n h盻妬 c盻ｧa API tra c盻ｩu s蘯｣nh: Th盻拱 gian ph蘯｣n h盻妬 trung bﾃｬnh ph蘯｣i \u003c 500ms.\\n- [ ] ﾄ塵 th盻拱 gian t蘯｣i trang Dashboard vﾃ trang L盻議h s盻ｱ ki盻㌻ trﾃｪn trﾃｬnh duy盻㏄: Th盻拱 gian t蘯｣i hoﾃn t蘯･t \u003c 3 giﾃ｢y.\\n- [ ] Ki盻ノ tra 盻ｩng d盻･ng khﾃｴng b盻・rﾃｲ r盻・b盻・nh盻・(Memory Leak) khi ch蘯｡y liﾃｪn t盻･c 24 gi盻・\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- Bﾃ｡o cﾃ｡o ki盻ノ th盻ｭ hi盻㎡ nﾄハg `docs/testing/performance-test-report.md`.\\n- Xﾃ｡c nh蘯ｭn h盻・th盻創g ﾄ妥｡p 盻ｩng ﾄ黛ｺｧy ﾄ黛ｻｧ tiﾃｪu chﾃｭ phi ch盻ｩc nﾄハg c盻ｧa ﾄ黛ｻ・ﾃ｡n.\\n\\n**Deadline:** 25/10/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm3ug\",\"name\":\"type: test\",\"description\":\"Test case vﾃ bﾃ｡o cﾃ｡o ki盻ノ th盻ｭ\",\"color\":\"0e8a16\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6kw\",\"name\":\"owner: hau\",\"description\":\"H蘯ｭu (Database \u0026 QA/Tester)\",\"color\":\"c5def5\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":153,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[DB/QA] QA-22: Ki盻ノ th盻ｭ hi盻㎡ nﾄハg h盻・th盻創g: ﾄ塵 th盻拱 gian t蘯｣i trang (\u003c3s) vﾃ kh蘯｣ nﾄハg ch盻丘 t蘯｣i cﾆ｡ b蘯｣n\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDODrKopQ\",\"login\":\"2005buinguyenchihau-alt\",\"name\":\"\",\"databaseId\":246589605}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nT盻貧g h盻｣p toﾃn b盻・s盻・li盻㎡ l盻擁 phﾃ｡t sinh trong d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n vﾃ v蘯ｽ Bi盻ブ ﾄ黛ｻ・Pareto 80/20 phﾃ｢n lo蘯｡i khuy蘯ｿt t蘯ｭt theo Chﾆｰﾆ｡ng 5.3 c盻ｧa Baocao.pdf.\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] Th盻創g kﾃｪ t盻貧g s盻・l盻擁 phﾃ｡t sinh trong cﾃ｡c ﾄ黛ｻ｣t test: L盻擁 tﾃｭnh toﾃ｡n sai, In 蘯･n thi蘯ｿu, L盻㌘h ngﾃy gi盻・ L盻擁 giao di盻㌻, L盻擁 m蘯･t k蘯ｿt n盻訴.\\n- [ ] L蘯ｭp b蘯｣ng t蘯ｧn s盻・xu蘯･t hi盻㌻ l盻擁, t盻ｷ l盻・% chi蘯ｿm vﾃ t盻ｷ l盻・% tﾃｭch lﾅｩy.\\n- [ ] V蘯ｽ Bi盻ブ ﾄ黛ｻ・Pareto k蘯ｿt h盻｣p: C盻冲 bi盻ブ di盻・ s盻・lﾆｰ盻｣ng l盻擁, ﾄ柁ｰ盻拵g cong bi盻ブ di盻・ % tﾃｭch lﾅｩy ﾄ黛ｺ｡t m盻祖 80%.\\n- [ ] ﾄ脆ｰa ra nh蘯ｭn xﾃｩt k蘯ｿt lu蘯ｭn: 80% l盻擁 b蘯ｯt ngu盻渡 t盻ｫ vi盻㌘ x盻ｭ lﾃｽ ngﾃy gi盻・vﾃ cﾃｴng th盻ｩc tﾃｭnh chi蘯ｿt kh蘯･u.\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- Tﾃi li盻㎡ phﾃ｢n tﾃｭch l盻擁 `docs/testing/pareto-defects-analysis.md`.\\n- File 蘯｣nh bi盻ブ ﾄ黛ｻ・Pareto `docs/testing/pareto-defects-chart.png` ﾄ黛ｻ・chﾃｨn vﾃo bﾃ｡o cﾃ｡o chﾃｭnh th盻ｩc.\\n\\n**Deadline:** 18/10/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm3Xg\",\"name\":\"type: docs\",\"description\":\"Tﾃi li盻㎡ d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n\",\"color\":\"e4e669\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6kw\",\"name\":\"owner: hau\",\"description\":\"H蘯ｭu (Database \u0026 QA/Tester)\",\"color\":\"c5def5\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":152,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[DB/QA] QA-21: T盻貧g h盻｣p s盻・li盻㎡ l盻擁 ph蘯ｧn m盻［ vﾃ v蘯ｽ Bi盻ブ ﾄ黛ｻ・Pareto 80/20 phﾃ｢n lo蘯｡i khuy蘯ｿt t蘯ｭt\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDODrKopQ\",\"login\":\"2005buinguyenchihau-alt\",\"name\":\"\",\"databaseId\":246589605}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nTh盻ｱc hi盻㌻ ki盻ノ th盻ｭ h盻妬 quy (Regression Testing) sau khi toﾃn b盻・cﾃ｡c l盻擁 BUG-01, 02, 03, 04 ﾄ妥｣ ﾄ柁ｰ盻｣c kh蘯ｯc ph盻･c.\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] Ch蘯｡y l蘯｡i toﾃn b盻・b盻・35 Test Cases t盻ｫ ﾄ黛ｺｧu ﾄ黛ｺｿn cu盻訴.\\n- [ ] ﾄ雪ｺ｣m b蘯｣o vi盻㌘ s盻ｭa l盻擁 Race Condition vﾃ mﾃｺi gi盻・khﾃｴng lﾃm phﾃ｡t sinh l盻擁 m盻嬖 盻・cﾃ｡c phﾃ｢n h盻・cﾅｩ.\\n- [ ] ﾄ塵 lﾆｰ盻拵g t盻ｷ l盻・Test Pass sau khi fix l盻擁: ﾄ雪ｺ｡t 100% (35/35 test cases ﾄ黛ｺ｡t yﾃｪu c蘯ｧu).\\n- [ ] Xﾃ｡c nh蘯ｭn ch蘯･t lﾆｰ盻｣ng b蘯｣n build ﾄ黛ｺ｡t tr蘯｡ng thﾃ｡i Feature Complete cho Tu蘯ｧn 6.\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- Bﾃ｡o cﾃ｡o ki盻ノ th盻ｭ h盻妬 quy `docs/testing/regression-test-report.md`.\\n- PM vﾃ QA Lead kﾃｽ xﾃ｡c nh蘯ｭn k蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ ki盻ノ th盻ｭ ﾄ黛ｺ｡t chu蘯ｩn.\\n\\n**Deadline:** 18/10/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm3ug\",\"name\":\"type: test\",\"description\":\"Test case vﾃ bﾃ｡o cﾃ｡o ki盻ノ th盻ｭ\",\"color\":\"0e8a16\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6kw\",\"name\":\"owner: hau\",\"description\":\"H蘯ｭu (Database \u0026 QA/Tester)\",\"color\":\"c5def5\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":151,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[DB/QA] QA-20: Th盻ｱc hi盻㌻ ki盻ノ th盻ｭ h盻妬 quy (Regression Testing) sau khi Backend \u0026 Frontend fix l盻擁\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDODrKopQ\",\"login\":\"2005buinguyenchihau-alt\",\"name\":\"\",\"databaseId\":246589605}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nKh盻殃 t蘯｡o Defect Ticket BUG-04: L盻擁 xung ﾄ黛ｻ冲 d盻ｯ li盻㎡ (Race Condition) khi 2 tﾆｰ v蘯･n viﾃｪn cﾃｹng b蘯･m gi盻ｯ s蘯｣nh cﾃｹng 1 giﾃ｢y.\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] Mﾃｴ t蘯｣ l盻擁: Hai nhﾃ｢n viﾃｪn Sales m盻・cﾃｹng 1 s蘯｣nh tr盻創g trﾃｪn 2 mﾃ｡y tﾃｭnh khﾃ｡c nhau vﾃ cﾃｹng b蘯･m nﾃｺt \u0027Xﾃ｡c nh蘯ｭn gi盻ｯ s蘯｣nh\u0027 ﾄ黛ｻ渡g th盻拱.\\n- [ ] H盻・qu蘯｣: C蘯｣ 2 h盻｣p ﾄ黛ｻ渡g ﾄ黛ｻ「 ﾄ柁ｰ盻｣c t蘯｡o thﾃnh cﾃｴng cho cﾃｹng 1 s蘯｣nh trong cﾃｹng ngﾃy (Trﾃｹng l盻議h nghiﾃｪm tr盻肱g).\\n- [ ] M盻ｩc ﾄ黛ｻ・nghiﾃｪm tr盻肱g: Critical (L盻擁 c蘯･p ﾄ黛ｻ・cao nh蘯･t ﾄ粗 d盻溝 s盻ｱ thﾃnh b蘯｡i c盻ｧa d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n).\\n- [ ] ﾄ雪ｻ・xu蘯･t gi蘯｣i phﾃ｡p: Backend b蘯ｯt bu盻冂 ph蘯｣i s盻ｭ d盻･ng Prisma `$transaction` v盻嬖 m盻ｩc cﾃｴ l蘯ｭp Serializable ho蘯ｷc khﾃｳa bi quan.\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- Ticket l盻擁 `type: bug`, `priority: high` trﾃｪn GitHub.\\n- Ph盻訴 h盻｣p v盻嬖 Phﾃｺc (BE) ch蘯｡y test gi蘯｣ l蘯ｭp ﾄ疎 lu盻渡g ﾄ黛ｻ・xﾃ｡c nh蘯ｭn l盻擁 ﾄ妥｣ ﾄ柁ｰ盻｣c kh蘯ｯc ph盻･c hoﾃn toﾃn.\\n\\n**Deadline:** 18/10/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm2sg\",\"name\":\"type: bug\",\"description\":\"L盻擁 c蘯ｧn s盻ｭa\",\"color\":\"d73a4a\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6kw\",\"name\":\"owner: hau\",\"description\":\"H蘯ｭu (Database \u0026 QA/Tester)\",\"color\":\"c5def5\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":150,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[DB/QA] QA-19: [BUG-04] Kh盻殃 t蘯｡o Defect: L盻擁 xung ﾄ黛ｻ冲 d盻ｯ li盻㎡ khi hai tﾆｰ v蘯･n viﾃｪn cﾃｹng b蘯･m gi盻ｯ s蘯｣nh cﾃｹng giﾃ｢y\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDODrKopQ\",\"login\":\"2005buinguyenchihau-alt\",\"name\":\"\",\"databaseId\":246589605}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nTh盻ｱc hi盻㌻ ki盻ノ th盻ｭ tﾃｭch h盻｣p toﾃn di盻㌻ (End-to-End Integration Testing) trﾃｪn mﾃｴi trﾆｰ盻拵g Staging.\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] Ch蘯｡y lu盻渡g xuyﾃｪn su盻奏 E2E: T蘯｡o khﾃ｡ch hﾃng -\u003e Tﾃｬm s蘯｣nh tr盻創g -\u003e Lﾃｪn th盻ｱc ﾄ柁｡n -\u003e Bﾃ｡o giﾃ｡ -\u003e T蘯｡o h盻｣p ﾄ黛ｻ渡g -\u003e N盻冪 ti盻］ c盻皇 -\u003e Xem Dashboard.\\n- [ ] Ki盻ノ tra tﾃｭnh nh蘯･t quﾃ｡n d盻ｯ li盻㎡: Sau khi n盻冪 c盻皇, s盻・ti盻］ hi盻ハ th盻・trﾃｪn Dashboard ph蘯｣i tﾄハg ngay l蘯ｭp t盻ｩc.\\n- [ ] Ki盻ノ tra trﾃｪn 2 tﾃi kho蘯｣n ﾄ惰ハg nh蘯ｭp ﾄ黛ｻ渡g th盻拱: M盻冲 Sales t蘯｡o h盻｣p ﾄ黛ｻ渡g, m盻冲 Thu ngﾃ｢n vﾃo xﾃ｡c nh蘯ｭn ti盻］ c盻皇.\\n- [ ] ﾄ塵 lﾆｰ盻拵g th盻拱 gian hoﾃn thﾃnh tr盻肱 v蘯ｹn 1 chu trﾃｬnh nghi盻㎝ v盻･ (\u003c 5 phﾃｺt).\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- Bﾃ｡o cﾃ｡o ki盻ノ th盻ｭ tﾃｭch h盻｣p E2E `docs/testing/integration-test-report.md`.\\n- Ghi nh蘯ｭn video quay l蘯｡i toﾃn b盻・quﾃ｡ trﾃｬnh test E