AC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":132,\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"[DB/QA] QA-01: Kh蘯｣o sﾃ｡t danh m盻･c cﾃ｡c th盻ｱc th盻・d盻ｯ li盻㎡ c蘯ｧn qu蘯｣n lﾃｽ trong h盻・th盻創g ti盻㌘ cﾆｰ盻嬖\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDODlJQCw\",\"login\":\"phucngo1707\",\"name\":\"\",\"databaseId\":240275467}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\r\\nHoﾃn thi盻㌻ tﾃi li盻㎡ bﾃn giao k盻ｹ thu蘯ｭt Backend, ﾄ妥ｳng gﾃｳi mﾃ｣ ngu盻渡 vﾃ bﾃn giao tr盻肱 v蘯ｹn cho PM nghi盻㍊ thu.\\r\\n\\r\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\r\\n- [ ] Vi蘯ｿt tﾃi li盻㎡ `backend/README.md` chi ti蘯ｿt: Yﾃｪu c蘯ｧu mﾃｴi trﾆｰ盻拵g (Java 20+, Docker), cﾃ｡c bﾆｰ盻嫩 cﾃi ﾄ黛ｺｷt vﾃ ch蘯｡y migrate.\\r\\n- [ ] D盻肱 d蘯ｹp mﾃ｣ ngu盻渡: Xﾃｳa cﾃ｡c route th盻ｭ nghi盻㍊, xﾃｳa file log rﾃ｡c vﾃ t盻訴 ﾆｰu hﾃｳa file `pom.xml`.\\r\\n- [ ] T蘯｡o Pull Request cu盻訴 cﾃｹng merge toﾃn b盻・code Backend vﾃo nhﾃ｡nh `develop`.\\r\\n- [ ] Bﾃn giao thﾃｴng tin tﾃi kho蘯｣n Cloud vﾃ cﾆ｡ s盻・d盻ｯ li盻㎡ cho PM Hoﾃng ﾄ妥ｳng d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n.\\r\\n\\r\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\r\\n- Mﾃ｣ ngu盻渡 Backend hoﾃn ch盻穎h trﾃｪn nhﾃ｡nh `develop`.\\r\\n- Tﾃi li盻㎡ bﾃn giao k盻ｹ thu蘯ｭt `docs/design/backend-handover.md`.\\r\\n\\r\\n**Deadline:** 01/11/2026\\r\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm3Xg\",\"name\":\"type: docs\",\"description\":\"Tﾃi li盻㎡ d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n\",\"color\":\"e4e669\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6NQ\",\"name\":\"owner: phuc\",\"description\":\"Phﾃｺc (Backend/API \u0026 DevOps)\",\"color\":\"e99695\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":131,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[Backend] BE-34: Bﾃn giao toﾃn b盻・mﾃ｣ ngu盻渡 Backend, c蘯･u hﾃｬnh mﾃｴi trﾆｰ盻拵g vﾃ tﾃi li盻㎡ API\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDODlJQCw\",\"login\":\"phucngo1707\",\"name\":\"\",\"databaseId\":240275467}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nThi蘯ｿt l蘯ｭp k盻議h b蘯｣n sao lﾆｰu vﾃ ph盻･c h盻妬 d盻ｯ li盻㎡ t盻ｱ ﾄ黛ｻ冢g (Database Backup \u0026 Restore Script) phﾃｲng ng盻ｫa r盻ｧi ro.\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] Vi蘯ｿt script bash `backup.sh` s盻ｭ d盻･ng ti盻㌻ ﾃｭch `pg_dump` ﾄ黛ｻ・xu蘯･t d盻ｯ li盻㎡ ra file `.sql.gz` cﾃｳ g蘯ｯn timestamp.\\n- [ ] Vi蘯ｿt script ph盻･c h盻妬 `restore.sh` cho phﾃｩp khﾃｴi ph盻･c l蘯｡i d盻ｯ li盻㎡ nguyﾃｪn v蘯ｹn khi x蘯｣y ra s盻ｱ c盻・h盻熟g hﾃｳc CSDL.\\n- [ ] Ki盻ノ tra th盻ｱc t蘯ｿ: T蘯｡o d盻ｯ li盻㎡ rﾃ｡c -\u003e Ch蘯｡y l盻㌻h restore -\u003e Xﾃ｡c nh蘯ｭn d盻ｯ li盻㎡ ph盻･c h盻妬 chﾃｭnh xﾃ｡c 100%.\\n- [ ] So蘯｡n th蘯｣o quy trﾃｬnh sao lﾆｰu ﾄ黛ｻ杵h k盻ｳ lﾆｰu tr盻ｯ vﾃo h盻・sﾆ｡ v蘯ｭn hﾃnh d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n.\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- B盻・script: `backend/scripts/backup.sh` vﾃ `restore.sh`.\\n- Tﾃi li盻㎡ hﾆｰ盻嬾g d蘯ｫn khﾃｴi ph盻･c d盻ｯ li盻㎡ `docs/planning/backup-restore-guide.md`.\\n\\n**Deadline:** 01/11/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm4Iw\",\"name\":\"type: chore\",\"description\":\"Setup, c蘯･u hﾃｬnh, tooling\",\"color\":\"e4e4e4\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6NQ\",\"name\":\"owner: phuc\",\"description\":\"Phﾃｺc (Backend/API \u0026 DevOps)\",\"color\":\"e99695\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm7VA\",\"name\":\"priority: medium\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn trung bﾃｬnh\",\"color\":\"fbca04\"}],\"number\":130,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[Backend] BE-33: Thi蘯ｿt l蘯ｭp k盻議h b蘯｣n sao lﾆｰu vﾃ ph盻･c h盻妬 d盻ｯ li盻㎡ t盻ｱ ﾄ黛ｻ冢g (Backup \u0026 Restore)\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDODlJQCw\",\"login\":\"phucngo1707\",\"name\":\"\",\"databaseId\":240275467}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\r\\nTﾃｭch h盻｣p tﾃi li盻㎡ Swagger / OpenAPI Spec t盻ｱ ﾄ黛ｻ冢g vﾃ tﾆｰﾆ｡ng tﾃ｡c tr盻ｱc ti蘯ｿp trﾃｪn trﾃｬnh duy盻㏄.\\r\\n\\r\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\r\\n- [ ] Cﾃi ﾄ黛ｺｷt thﾆｰ vi盻㌻ `@Spring Boot/swagger` vﾃ `swagger-ui-Spring Web`.\\r\\n- [ ] G蘯ｯn cﾃ｡c decorator `@ApiTags()`, `@ApiOperation()`, `@ApiResponse()`, `@ApiBearerAuth()` cho toﾃn b盻・controllers.\\r\\n- [ ] G蘯ｯn `@ApiProperty()` mﾃｴ t蘯｣ ki盻ブ d盻ｯ li盻㎡, vﾃｭ d盻･ m蘯ｫu vﾃ tﾃｭnh b蘯ｯt bu盻冂 cho toﾃn b盻・DTOs.\\r\\n- [ ] Xu蘯･t b蘯｣n tﾃi li盻㎡ tﾆｰﾆ｡ng tﾃ｡c t蘯｡i ﾄ柁ｰ盻拵g d蘯ｫn `/api/docs` cho phﾃｩp g盻ｭi request test tr盻ｱc ti蘯ｿp trﾃｪn web.\\r\\n\\r\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\r\\n- Giao di盻㌻ Swagger UI ho蘯｡t ﾄ黛ｻ冢g hoﾃn h蘯｣o t蘯｡i `/api/docs`.\\r\\n- Xu蘯･t file `swagger-spec.json` lﾆｰu t蘯｡i `docs/design/openapi-spec.json`.\\r\\n\\r\\n**Deadline:** 01/11/2026\\r\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm3Xg\",\"name\":\"type: docs\",\"description\":\"Tﾃi li盻㎡ d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n\",\"color\":\"e4e669\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6NQ\",\"name\":\"owner: phuc\",\"description\":\"Phﾃｺc (Backend/API \u0026 DevOps)\",\"color\":\"e99695\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":129,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[Backend] BE-32: Tﾃｭch h盻｣p Swagger / OpenAPI Spec t盻ｱ ﾄ黛ｻ冢g sinh tﾃi li盻㎡ API ﾄ黛ｺｧy ﾄ黛ｻｧ\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDODlJQCw\",\"login\":\"phucngo1707\",\"name\":\"\",\"databaseId\":240275467}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nS盻ｭa cﾃ｡c l盻擁 logic Backend do ﾄ黛ｻ冓 ngﾅｩ QA ghi nh蘯ｭn trong Defect Log trong ﾄ黛ｻ｣t ki盻ノ th盻ｭ tﾃｭch h盻｣p.\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] S盻ｭa l盻擁 BUG-01: Chu蘯ｩn hﾃｳa username/email v盻・ch盻ｯ thﾆｰ盻拵g (lowercase) trﾆｰ盻嫩 khi ﾄ黛ｻ訴 chi蘯ｿu ﾄ惰ハg nh蘯ｭp.\\n- [ ] S盻ｭa l盻擁 BUG-02: ﾄ雪ｻ渡g b盻・mﾃｺi gi盻・UTC+7 cho cﾃ｡c trﾆｰ盻拵g DateTime ﾄ黛ｻ・trﾃ｡nh l盻㌘h ngﾃy ﾄ黛ｺｷt ti盻㌘.\\n- [ ] S盻ｭa l盻擁 BUG-03: S盻ｭa l蘯｡i cﾃｴng th盻ｩc tﾃｭnh chi蘯ｿt kh蘯･u kﾃｩp trong Service tﾃｭnh ti盻］ h盻｣p ﾄ黛ｻ渡g.\\n- [ ] S盻ｭa l盻擁 BUG-04: B盻・sung Transaction lock ngﾄハ ch蘯ｷn ﾄ黛ｺｷt trﾃｹng s蘯｣nh khi cﾃｳ 2 request ﾄ黛ｻ渡g th盻拱.\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- Cﾃ｡c commit s盻ｭa bug trﾃｪn nhﾃ｡nh `feature/backend-core`.\\n- G盻ｭi tag QA H蘯ｭu vﾃo re-test vﾃ ﾄ妥ｳng cﾃ｡c ticket bug tﾆｰﾆ｡ng 盻ｩng.\\n\\n**Deadline:** 25/10/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm2sg\",\"name\":\"type: bug\",\"description\":\"L盻擁 c蘯ｧn s盻ｭa\",\"color\":\"d73a4a\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6NQ\",\"name\":\"owner: phuc\",\"description\":\"Phﾃｺc (Backend/API \u0026 DevOps)\",\"color\":\"e99695\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":128,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[Backend] BE-31: S盻ｭa cﾃ｡c l盻擁 backend do QA ghi nh蘯ｭn trong Defect Log\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDODlJQCw\",\"login\":\"phucngo1707\",\"name\":\"\",\"databaseId\":240275467}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\r\\r\\nTri盻ハ khai Backend API vﾃ Database PostgreSQL lﾃｪn h蘯｡ t蘯ｧng Cloud (Render / Railway / VPS) ph盻･c v盻･ ki盻ノ th盻ｭ UAT.\\r\\r\\n\\r\\r\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\r\\r\\n- [ ] T蘯｡o cﾆ｡ s盻・d盻ｯ li盻㎡ PostgreSQL Managed Database trﾃｪn Cloud (Supabase ho蘯ｷc Neon).\\r\\r\\n- [ ] Ch蘯｡y l盻㌻h `npx JPA / Hibernate migrate deploy` ﾄ黛ｻ・ﾄ黛ｻ渡g b盻・toﾃn b盻・c蘯･u trﾃｺc b蘯｣ng lﾃｪn database cloud.\\r\\r\\n- [ ] N蘯｡p d盻ｯ li盻㎡ m蘯ｫu (Seed Data) lﾃｪn mﾃｴi trﾆｰ盻拵g cloud b蘯ｱng l盻㌻h `npx JPA / Hibernate db seed`.\\r\\r\\n- [ ] Deploy 盻ｩng d盻･ng Spring Boot lﾃｪn Render/Railway, c蘯･u hﾃｬnh ﾄ黛ｺｧy ﾄ黛ｻｧ cﾃ｡c bi蘯ｿn mﾃｴi trﾆｰ盻拵g Production.\\r\\r\\n- [ ] Ki盻ノ tra endpoint Health Check `GET /api/health` tr蘯｣ v盻・`{ status: \u0027ok\u0027 }` v盻嬖 tﾃｪn mi盻］ HTTPS cﾃｴng khai.\\r\\r\\n\\r\\r\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\r\\r\\n- ﾄ脆ｰ盻拵g link API Staging cﾃｴng khai (VD: `https://evmanager-api.onrender.com/api`).\\r\\r\\n- Bﾃn giao link API cho Frontend vﾃ QA ki盻ノ th盻ｭ UAT.\\r\\r\\n\\r\\r\\n**Deadline:** 25/10/2026\\r\\r\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm4Iw\",\"name\":\"type: chore\",\"description\":\"Setup, c蘯･u hﾃｬnh, tooling\",\"color\":\"e4e4e4\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6NQ\",\"name\":\"owner: phuc\",\"description\":\"Phﾃｺc (Backend/API \u0026 DevOps)\",\"color\":\"e99695\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":127,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[Backend] BE-30: Tri盻ハ khai Backend API lﾃｪn mﾃｴi trﾆｰ盻拵g Staging/Cloud ph盻･c v盻･ ki盻ノ th盻ｭ UAT\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDODlJQCw\",\"login\":\"phucngo1707\",\"name\":\"\",\"databaseId\":240275467}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\r\\r\\nC蘯･u hﾃｬnh B蘯｣o m蘯ｭt Backend: Ch盻創g t蘯･n cﾃｴng Brute-force v盻嬖 Rate Limiting vﾃ b蘯｣o v盻・HTTP Header b蘯ｱng Spring Security Headers.\\r\\r\\n\\r\\r\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\r\\r\\n- [ ] Cﾃi ﾄ黛ｺｷt thﾆｰ vi盻㌻ `@Spring Boot/throttler` c蘯･u hﾃｬnh gi盻嬖 h蘯｡n s盻・lﾆｰ盻｣ng request (VD: T盻訴 ﾄ疎 100 req/phﾃｺt, riﾃｪng route Login t盻訴 ﾄ疎 5 req/phﾃｺt).\\r\\r\\n- [ ] Cﾃi ﾄ黛ｺｷt thﾆｰ vi盻㌻ `Spring Security Headers` ﾄ黛ｻ・che gi蘯･u thﾃｴng tin cﾃｴng ngh盻・(蘯ｩn header X-Powered-By) vﾃ ch盻創g t蘯･n cﾃｴng XSS, Clickjacking.\\r\\r\\n- [ ] C蘯･u hﾃｬnh CORS nghiﾃｪm ng蘯ｷt: Ch盻・ch蘯･p nh蘯ｭn request t盻ｫ domain chﾃｭnh th盻ｩc c盻ｧa Frontend.\\r\\r\\n- [ ] Ch蘯ｷn cﾃ｡c chu盻擁 kﾃｽ t盻ｱ t蘯･n cﾃｴng SQL Injection thﾃｴng qua vi盻㌘ s盻ｭ d盻･ng tham s盻・hﾃｳa c盻ｧa JPA / Hibernate ORM.\\r\\r\\n\\r\\r\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\r\\r\\n- Mﾃ｣ ngu盻渡 c蘯･u hﾃｬnh b蘯｣o m蘯ｭt trong `backend/src/app.module.java` vﾃ `c蘯･u hﾃｬnh Spring (SecurityConfig / WebMvcConfigurer)`.\\r\\r\\n- Ki盻ノ tra th盻ｭ nghi盻㍊ g盻ｭi request d盻渡 d蘯ｭp vﾃ nh蘯ｭn mﾃ｣ l盻擁 HTTP 429 Too Many Requests.\\r\\r\\n\\r\\r\\n**Deadline:** 25/10/2026\\r\\r\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm4Iw\",\"name\":\"type: chore\",\"description\":\"Setup, c蘯･u hﾃｬnh, tooling\",\"color\":\"e4e4e4\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6NQ\",\"name\":\"owner: phuc\",\"description\":\"Phﾃｺc (Backend/API \u0026 DevOps)\",\"color\":\"e99695\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":126,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[Backend] BE-29: C蘯･u hﾃｬnh CORS, Rate Limiting vﾃ b蘯｣o m蘯ｭt Header v盻嬖 Helmet\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDODlJQCw\",\"login\":\"phucngo1707\",\"name\":\"\",\"databaseId\":240275467}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\r\\r\\nT盻訴 ﾆｰu hﾃｳa hi盻㎡ nﾄハg cﾆ｡ s盻・d盻ｯ li盻㎡: ﾄ静｡nh ch盻・m盻･c Index cho cﾃ｡c trﾆｰ盻拵g tra c盻ｩu thﾆｰ盻拵g xuyﾃｪn.\\r\\r\\n\\r\\r\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\r\\r\\n- [ ] Phﾃ｢n tﾃｭch cﾃ｡c cﾃ｢u truy v蘯･n ch蘯ｭm (Slow Queries) b蘯ｱng l盻㌻h `EXPLAIN ANALYZE` trong PostgreSQL.\\r\\r\\n- [ ] Thﾃｪm Index trong `schema.JPA / Hibernate` cho cﾃ｡c c盻冲: `customer_phone`, `event_date`, `contract_status`, `venue_id`.\\r\\r\\n- [ ] Thﾃｪm Composite Index `[venueId, eventDate]` ﾄ黛ｻ・t盻訴 ﾆｰu hﾃｳa t盻祖 ﾄ黛ｻ・c盻ｧa hﾃm Conflict Checker.\\r\\r\\n- [ ] Ch蘯｡y migration b盻・sung index vﾃ ﾄ双 lﾆｰ盻拵g th盻拱 gian truy v蘯･n gi蘯｣m t盻ｫ \u003e200ms xu盻創g \u003c30ms.\\r\\r\\n\\r\\r\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\r\\r\\n- File migration JPA / Hibernate b盻・sung Index vﾃ file `schema.JPA / Hibernate` c蘯ｭp nh蘯ｭt.\\r\\r\\n- Bﾃ｡o cﾃ｡o k蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ ﾄ双 th盻拱 gian ph蘯｣n h盻妬 trﾆｰ盻嫩 vﾃ sau khi ﾄ妥｡nh index.\\r\\r\\n\\r\\r\\n**Deadline:** 25/10/2026\\r\\r\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm2GQ\",\"name\":\"type: feature\",\"description\":\"Ch盻ｩc nﾄハg m盻嬖\",\"color\":\"0075ca\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6NQ\",\"name\":\"owner: phuc\",\"description\":\"Phﾃｺc (Backend/API \u0026 DevOps)\",\"color\":\"e99695\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm7VA\",\"name\":\"priority: medium\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn trung bﾃｬnh\",\"color\":\"fbca04\"}],\"number\":125,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[Backend] BE-28: T盻訴 ﾆｰu hﾃｳa hi盻㎡ nﾄハg cﾆ｡ s盻・d盻ｯ li盻㎡: ﾄ静｡nh ch盻・m盻･c Index cho cﾃ｡c trﾆｰ盻拵g tra c盻ｩu\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDODlJQCw\",\"login\":\"phucngo1707\",\"name\":\"\",\"databaseId\":240275467}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\r\\r\\nThi蘯ｿt l蘯ｭp GitHub Actions CI Pipeline t盻ｱ ﾄ黛ｻ冢g ch蘯｡y Lint, Build vﾃ Unit Test m盻擁 khi cﾃｳ Pull Request.\\r\\r\\n\\r\\r\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\r\\r\\n- [ ] T蘯｡o file workflow `.github/workflows/backend-ci.yml` kﾃｭch ho蘯｡t khi cﾃｳ Push ho蘯ｷc PR vﾃo nhﾃ｡nh `develop`.\\r\\r\\n- [ ] Thi蘯ｿt l蘯ｭp mﾃｴi trﾆｰ盻拵g Ubuntu, cﾃi ﾄ黛ｺｷt Java 20, cache dependencies ﾄ黛ｻ・tﾄハg t盻祖 ﾄ黛ｻ・ch蘯｡