\"number\":122,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[Backend] BE-25: Xﾃ｢y d盻ｱng Service xu蘯･t d盻ｯ li盻㎡ h盻｣p ﾄ黛ｻ渡g ti盻㌘ cﾆｰ盻嬖 ra ﾄ黛ｻ杵h d蘯｡ng PDF\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDODlJQCw\",\"login\":\"phucngo1707\",\"name\":\"\",\"databaseId\":240275467}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\r\\r\\nXﾃ｢y d盻ｱng Service xu蘯･t bﾃ｡o cﾃ｡o danh sﾃ｡ch ti盻㌘ cﾆｰ盻嬖 vﾃ doanh thu ra file Excel chu蘯ｩn ﾄ黛ｻ杵h d蘯｡ng b蘯ｱng Apache POI.\\r\\r\\n\\r\\r\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\r\\r\\n- [ ] Cﾃi ﾄ黛ｺｷt thﾆｰ vi盻㌻ `Apache POI` trong d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n Spring Boot.\\r\\r\\n- [ ] T蘯｡o Service ﾄ黛ｻ杵h d蘯｡ng file Excel chuyﾃｪn nghi盻㎝: Thﾃｪm tiﾃｪu ﾄ黛ｻ・cﾃｴng ty, ﾄ黛ｻ杵h d蘯｡ng mﾃu s蘯ｯc header, k蘯ｻ khung vi盻］ (Borders).\\r\\r\\n- [ ] Thﾃｪm c盻冲 cﾃｴng th盻ｩc tﾃｭnh t盻貧g ti盻］ t盻ｱ ﾄ黛ｻ冢g trong Excel: `=SUM(G5:G20)`.\\r\\r\\n- [ ] Tr蘯｣ v盻・file dﾆｰ盻嬖 d蘯｡ng Stream kﾃｨm Header HTTP: `Content-Disposition: attachment; filename=BaoCao_DoanhThu.xlsx`.\\r\\r\\n\\r\\r\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\r\\r\\n- Mﾃ｣ ngu盻渡: `backend/src/reports/excel-export.service.java`.\\r\\r\\n- T蘯｣i th盻ｭ nghi盻㍊ file Excel vﾃ m盻・ki盻ノ tra trﾃｪn Microsoft Excel.\\r\\r\\n\\r\\r\\n**Deadline:** 18/10/2026\\r\\r\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm2GQ\",\"name\":\"type: feature\",\"description\":\"Ch盻ｩc nﾄハg m盻嬖\",\"color\":\"0075ca\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6NQ\",\"name\":\"owner: phuc\",\"description\":\"Phﾃｺc (Backend/API \u0026 DevOps)\",\"color\":\"e99695\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm7VA\",\"name\":\"priority: medium\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn trung bﾃｬnh\",\"color\":\"fbca04\"}],\"number\":121,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[Backend] BE-24: Xﾃ｢y d盻ｱng Service xu蘯･t bﾃ｡o cﾃ｡o th盻創g kﾃｪ danh sﾃ｡ch s盻ｱ ki盻㌻ ra file Excel (ExcelJS)\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDODlJQCw\",\"login\":\"phucngo1707\",\"name\":\"\",\"databaseId\":240275467}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nPhﾃ｡t tri盻ハ API Bﾃ｡o cﾃ｡o: Th盻創g kﾃｪ t蘯ｧn su蘯･t s盻ｭ d盻･ng vﾃ t盻ｷ l盻・l蘯･p ﾄ黛ｺｧy c盻ｧa t盻ｫng s蘯｣nh ti盻㌘.\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] Vi蘯ｿt API `GET /api/reports/venue-occupancy`: Nh蘯ｭn kho蘯｣ng th盻拱 gian t盻ｫ ngﾃy... ﾄ黛ｺｿn ngﾃy...\\n- [ ] Tﾃｭnh t盻ｷ l盻・l蘯･p ﾄ黛ｺｧy s蘯｣nh: $Occupancy = (S盻・ca ti盻㌘ th盻ｱc t蘯ｿ / T盻貧g s盻・ca ti盻㌘ kh蘯｣ d盻･ng trong thﾃ｡ng) \\\\times 100\\\\%$.\\n- [ ] X蘯ｿp h蘯｡ng cﾃ｡c s蘯｣nh ti盻㌘ mang l蘯｡i doanh thu cao nh蘯･t cho trung tﾃ｢m.\\n- [ ] Cung c蘯･p s盻・li盻㎡ ﾄ黛ｻ・Ban Giﾃ｡m ﾄ黛ｻ祖 ﾄ柁ｰa ra chﾃｭnh sﾃ｡ch ﾄ訴盻「 ch盻穎h giﾃ｡ thuﾃｪ s蘯｣nh mﾃｹa th蘯･p ﾄ訴盻ノ.\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- Mﾃ｣ ngu盻渡 endpoint trong `ReportsController`.\\n- Xu蘯･t tﾃi li盻㎡ mﾃｴ t蘯｣ cﾃｴng th盻ｩc tﾃｭnh toﾃ｡n vﾃo comment issue.\\n\\n**Deadline:** 18/10/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm2GQ\",\"name\":\"type: feature\",\"description\":\"Ch盻ｩc nﾄハg m盻嬖\",\"color\":\"0075ca\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6NQ\",\"name\":\"owner: phuc\",\"description\":\"Phﾃｺc (Backend/API \u0026 DevOps)\",\"color\":\"e99695\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":120,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[Backend] BE-23: Phﾃ｡t tri盻ハ API Bﾃ｡o cﾃ｡o: Th盻創g kﾃｪ s盻・lﾆｰ盻｣ng ti盻㌘ cﾆｰ盻嬖 vﾃ t盻ｷ l盻・l蘯･p ﾄ黛ｺｧy s蘯｣nh\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDODlJQCw\",\"login\":\"phucngo1707\",\"name\":\"\",\"databaseId\":240275467}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\r\\nPhﾃ｡t tri盻ハ Module Dashboard: Vi蘯ｿt cﾃ｢u truy v蘯･n t盻貧g h盻｣p th盻創g kﾃｪ doanh thu vﾃ ch盻・s盻・v蘯ｭn hﾃnh.\\r\\n\\r\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\r\\n- [ ] Vi蘯ｿt API `GET /api/dashboard/stats`: Th盻創g kﾃｪ t盻貧g doanh thu thﾃ｡ng hi盻㌻ t蘯｡i, t盻ｷ l盻・tﾄハg trﾆｰ盻殤g so v盻嬖 thﾃ｡ng trﾆｰ盻嫩.\\r\\n- [ ] Vi蘯ｿt cﾃ｢u l盻㌻h SQL Group By t盻貧g h盻｣p doanh thu theo t盻ｫng thﾃ｡ng trong nﾄノ ﾄ黛ｻ・ph盻･c v盻･ bi盻ブ ﾄ黛ｻ・c盻冲.\\r\\n- [ ] Th盻創g kﾃｪ s盻・lﾆｰ盻｣ng h盻｣p ﾄ黛ｻ渡g theo t盻ｫng tr蘯｡ng thﾃ｡i (ﾄ静｣ c盻皇, ﾄ紳ng ti盻㌘, ﾄ静｣ thanh lﾃｽ, ﾄ静｣ h盻ｧy).\\r\\n- [ ] T盻訴 ﾆｰu hﾃｳa query database s盻ｭ d盻･ng cﾃ｢u l盻㌻h Raw Query ho蘯ｷc JPA / Hibernate Aggregate ﾄ黛ｻ・tﾄハg t盻祖 ﾄ黛ｻ・ph蘯｣n h盻妬 \u003c 500ms.\\r\\n\\r\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\r\\n- Mﾃ｣ ngu盻渡: `backend/src/dashboard/` controller vﾃ service.\\r\\n- Tﾃｭch h盻｣p API s盻・li盻㎡ Dashboard cho Frontend Nhﾃ｢n.\\r\\n\\r\\n**Deadline:** 18/10/2026\\r\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm2GQ\",\"name\":\"type: feature\",\"description\":\"Ch盻ｩc nﾄハg m盻嬖\",\"color\":\"0075ca\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6NQ\",\"name\":\"owner: phuc\",\"description\":\"Phﾃｺc (Backend/API \u0026 DevOps)\",\"color\":\"e99695\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":119,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[Backend] BE-22: Phﾃ｡t tri盻ハ Module Dashboard: Vi蘯ｿt cﾃ｢u l盻㌻h t盻貧g h盻｣p th盻創g kﾃｪ doanh thu theo thﾃ｡ng\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDODlJQCw\",\"login\":\"phucngo1707\",\"name\":\"\",\"databaseId\":240275467}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\r\\nXﾃ｢y d盻ｱng Database Transaction ﾄ黛ｺ｣m b蘯｣o tﾃｭnh toﾃn v蘯ｹn (ACID) khi ﾄ黛ｻ渡g th盻拱 t蘯｡o H盻｣p ﾄ黛ｻ渡g, gi盻ｯ s蘯｣nh vﾃ thu c盻皇.\\r\\n\\r\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\r\\n- [ ] S盻ｭ d盻･ng tﾃｭnh nﾄハg `JPA / Hibernate.$transaction()` ﾄ黛ｻ・b盻皇 toﾃn b盻・thao tﾃ｡c t蘯｡o h盻｣p ﾄ黛ｻ渡g vﾃ c蘯ｭp nh蘯ｭt tr蘯｡ng thﾃ｡i s蘯｣nh.\\r\\n- [ ] ﾃ｝ d盻･ng cﾆ｡ ch蘯ｿ khﾃｳa d盻ｯ li盻㎡ (Pessimistic Lock / Serialized Transaction) ﾄ黛ｻ・ch盻創g tﾃｬnh tr蘯｡ng Race Condition khi 2 tﾆｰ v蘯･n viﾃｪn cﾃｹng b蘯･m gi盻ｯ s蘯｣nh cﾃｹng 1 giﾃ｢y.\\r\\n- [ ] N蘯ｿu cﾃｳ b蘯･t k盻ｳ bﾆｰ盻嫩 nﾃo th蘯･t b蘯｡i (VD: l盻擁 thanh toﾃ｡n), t盻ｱ ﾄ黛ｻ冢g Rollback toﾃn b盻・d盻ｯ li盻㎡ v盻・tr蘯｡ng thﾃ｡i ban ﾄ黛ｺｧu.\\r\\n- [ ] Ghi log chi ti蘯ｿt cﾃ｡c trﾆｰ盻拵g h盻｣p giao d盻議h b盻・Rollback ﾄ黛ｻ・theo dﾃｵi.\\r\\n\\r\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\r\\n- Mﾃ｣ ngu盻渡 x盻ｭ lﾃｽ Transaction trong `ContractsService.createContractWithTransaction()`.\\r\\n- Vi蘯ｿt k盻議h b蘯｣n test gi蘯｣ l蘯ｭp 2 request ﾄ黛ｻ渡g th盻拱 ﾄ黛ｻ・ki盻ノ tra tﾃｭnh toﾃn v蘯ｹn.\\r\\n\\r\\n**Deadline:** 11/10/2026\\r\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm2GQ\",\"name\":\"type: feature\",\"description\":\"Ch盻ｩc nﾄハg m盻嬖\",\"color\":\"0075ca\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6NQ\",\"name\":\"owner: phuc\",\"description\":\"Phﾃｺc (Backend/API \u0026 DevOps)\",\"color\":\"e99695\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":118,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[Backend] BE-21: Xﾃ｢y d盻ｱng Database Transaction ﾄ黛ｺ｣m b蘯｣o tﾃｭnh nguyﾃｪn t盻ｭ khi t蘯｡o H盻｣p ﾄ黛ｻ渡g \u0026 C盻皇\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDODlJQCw\",\"login\":\"phucngo1707\",\"name\":\"\",\"databaseId\":240275467}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nPhﾃ｡t tri盻ハ Module Payments: API Ghi nh蘯ｭn ﾄ黛ｺｷt c盻皇 ﾄ黛ｻ｣t 1 vﾃ quy蘯ｿt toﾃ｡n ﾄ黛ｻ｣t 2 c盻ｧa h盻｣p ﾄ黛ｻ渡g.\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] T蘯｡o b蘯｣ng `payments`: contractId, amount, paymentDate, paymentMethod (CASH, BANK_TRANSFER, POS), paymentType (DEPOSIT, FINAL), notes.\\n- [ ] Vi蘯ｿt API `POST /api/payments`: Ghi nh蘯ｭn giao d盻議h n盻冪 ti盻］, t盻ｱ ﾄ黛ｻ冢g c蘯ｭp nh蘯ｭt s盻・ti盻］ ﾄ妥｣ tr蘯｣ vﾃ cﾃｴng n盻｣ cﾃｲn l蘯｡i trong b蘯｣ng contracts.\\n- [ ] Vi蘯ｿt API `GET /api/contracts/:id/payments`: L蘯･y l盻議h s盻ｭ toﾃn b盻・cﾃ｡c l蘯ｧn thanh toﾃ｡n c盻ｧa m盻冲 h盻｣p ﾄ黛ｻ渡g.\\n- [ ] Ch蘯ｷn ghi nh蘯ｭn thanh toﾃ｡n vﾆｰ盻｣t quﾃ｡ t盻貧g giﾃ｡ tr盻・h盻｣p ﾄ黛ｻ渡g c蘯ｧn thu.\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- Mﾃ｣ ngu盻渡: `backend/src/payments/` controller vﾃ service.\\n- Ki盻ノ tra ﾄ黛ｻ渡g b盻・s盻・dﾆｰ cﾃｴng n盻｣ sau m盻擁 l蘯ｧn n蘯｡p ti盻］.\\n\\n**Deadline:** 11/10/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm2GQ\",\"name\":\"type: feature\",\"description\":\"Ch盻ｩc nﾄハg m盻嬖\",\"color\":\"0075ca\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6NQ\",\"name\":\"owner: phuc\",\"description\":\"Phﾃｺc (Backend/API \u0026 DevOps)\",\"color\":\"e99695\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":117,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[Backend] BE-20: Phﾃ｡t tri盻ハ Module Payments: API Ghi nh蘯ｭn ti盻］ ﾄ黛ｺｷt c盻皇 ﾄ黛ｻ｣t 1 vﾃ thanh toﾃ｡n ﾄ黛ｻ｣t 2\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDODlJQCw\",\"login\":\"phucngo1707\",\"name\":\"\",\"databaseId\":240275467}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\r\\nXﾃ｢y d盻ｱng State Machine qu蘯｣n lﾃｽ nghiﾃｪm ng蘯ｷt vﾃｲng ﾄ黛ｻ拱 c盻ｧa H盻｣p ﾄ黛ｻ渡g ti盻㌘ cﾆｰ盻嬖 (Contract Lifecycle).\\r\\n\\r\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\r\\n- [ ] ﾄ雪ｻ杵h nghﾄｩa enum ContractStatus: `DRAFT` (B蘯｣n th蘯｣o) -\u003e `PENDING_DEPOSIT` (Ch盻・c盻皇) -\u003e `CONFIRMED` (ﾄ静｣ c盻皇) -\u003e `IN_PROGRESS` (ﾄ紳ng t盻・ch盻ｩc) -\u003e `COMPLETED` (ﾄ静｣ thanh lﾃｽ) -\u003e `CANCELLED` (ﾄ静｣ h盻ｧy).\\r\\n- [ ] Vi蘯ｿt logic ki盻ノ tra ﾄ訴盻「 ki盻㌻ chuy盻ハ tr蘯｡ng thﾃ｡i: Ch盻・ﾄ柁ｰ盻｣c chuy盻ハ sang `CONFIRMED` khi s盻・ti盻］ c盻皇 $\\\\ge 30\\\\%$.\\r\\n- [ ] Ch蘯ｷn c蘯ｭp nh蘯ｭt th盻ｱc ﾄ柁｡n ho蘯ｷc s盻・bﾃn ﾄ黛ｻ訴 v盻嬖 h盻｣p ﾄ黛ｻ渡g ﾄ妥｣ 盻・tr蘯｡ng thﾃ｡i `COMPLETED` ho蘯ｷc `CANCELLED`.\\r\\n- [ ] T盻ｱ ﾄ黛ｻ冢g gi蘯｣i phﾃｳng s蘯｣nh ti盻㌘ khi h盻｣p ﾄ黛ｻ渡g b盻・chuy盻ハ sang tr蘯｡ng thﾃ｡i `CANCELLED`.\\r\\n\\r\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\r\\n- Mﾃ｣ ngu盻渡: `backend/src/contracts/contract-state-machine.java`.\\r\\n- Vi蘯ｿt unit test ki盻ノ th盻ｭ cﾃ｡c bﾆｰ盻嫩 chuy盻ハ tr蘯｡ng thﾃ｡i h盻｣p l盻・vﾃ b蘯･t h盻｣p l盻・\\r\\n\\r\\n**Deadline:** 11/10/2026\\r\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm2GQ\",\"name\":\"type: feature\",\"description\":\"Ch盻ｩc nﾄハg m盻嬖\",\"color\":\"0075ca\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6NQ\",\"name\":\"owner: phuc\",\"description\":\"Phﾃｺc (Backend/API \u0026 DevOps)\",\"color\":\"e99695\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":116,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[Backend] BE-19: Xﾃ｢y d盻ｱng State Machine qu蘯｣n lﾃｽ vﾃｲng ﾄ黛ｻ拱 h盻｣p ﾄ黛ｻ渡g (Draft -\u003e Confirmed -\u003e Completed)\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDODlJQCw\",\"login\":\"phucngo1707\",\"name\":\"\",\"databaseId\":240275467}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nPhﾃ｡t tri盻ハ Module Contracts: API T蘯｡o ﾄ柁｡n ﾄ黛ｺｷt ti盻㌘, tﾃｭnh toﾃ｡n t盻貧g chi phﾃｭ vﾃ sinh mﾃ｣ h盻｣p ﾄ黛ｻ渡g t盻ｱ ﾄ黛ｻ冢g.\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] Vi蘯ｿt DTO `CreateContractDto` nh蘯ｭn: customerId, venueId, eventDate, shift, tableCount, menuId, serviceIds, discountPercent.\\n- [ ] T盻ｱ ﾄ黛ｻ冢g tﾃｭnh toﾃ｡n chi phﾃｭ: $T盻貧g = (S盻・bﾃn \\\\times Giﾃ｡ bﾃn) + T盻貧g ti盻］ d盻議h v盻･ - Ti盻］ gi蘯｣m giﾃ｡ + VAT$.\\n- [ ] T盻ｱ ﾄ黛ｻ冢g sinh mﾃ｣ h盻｣p ﾄ黛ｻ渡g duy nh蘯･t theo quy t蘯ｯc: `HD-YYYYMMDD-STT` (VD: `HD-20261010-001`).\\n- [ ] Trﾆｰ盻嫩 khi t蘯｡o h盻｣p ﾄ黛ｻ渡g, g盻絞 Conflict Checker ﾄ黛ｻ・khﾃｳa gi盻ｯ s蘯｣nh ti盻㌘ t盻ｩc thﾃｬ.\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- Mﾃ｣ ngu盻渡: `backend/src/contracts/` controller vﾃ service.\\n- Ki盻ノ tra tﾃｭnh toﾃ｡n ti盻］ chﾃｭnh xﾃ｡c tuy盻㏄ ﾄ黛ｻ訴 khﾃｴng b盻・l盻擁 lﾃm trﾃｲn s盻・\\n\\n**Deadline:** 11/10/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm2GQ\",\"name\":\"type: feature\",\"description\":\"Ch盻ｩc nﾄハg m盻嬖\",\"color\":\"0075ca\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6NQ\",\"name\":\"owner: phuc\",\"description\":\"Phﾃｺc (Backend/API \u0026 DevOps)\",\"color\":\"e99695\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":115,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[Backend] BE-18: Phﾃ｡t tri盻ハ Module Contracts: API T蘯｡o ﾄ柁｡n ﾄ黛ｺｷt ti盻㌘, tﾃｭnh chi phﾃｭ vﾃ chi蘯ｿt kh蘯･u\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDODlJQCw\",\"login\":\"phucngo1707\",\"name\":\"\",\"databaseId\":240275467}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nPhﾃ｡t tri盻ハ Module Services: API Qu蘯｣n lﾃｽ danh m盻･c cﾃ｡c gﾃｳi d盻議h v盻･ gia tﾄハg ti盻㌘ cﾆｰ盻嬖.\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] T蘯｡o b蘯｣ng `services` (MC, Ban nh蘯｡c, Hoa tﾆｰﾆ｡i, Thﾃ｡p rﾆｰ盻｣u, Phﾃ｡o kim tuy蘯ｿn) kﾃｨm ﾄ柁｡n giﾃ｡ vﾃ ﾄ柁｡n v盻・tﾃｭnh.\\n- [ ] Vi蘯ｿt API `GET /api/services`: L蘯･y danh sﾃ｡ch d盻議h v盻･ ﾄ疎ng ho蘯｡t ﾄ黛ｻ冢g ph盻･c v盻･ mﾃn hﾃｬnh ch盻肱 d盻議h v盻･.\\n- [ ] Vi蘯ｿt API `POST /api/services`: Thﾃｪm m盻嬖 gﾃｳi d盻議h v盻･ tﾃｹy ch盻肱.\\n- [ ] Vi蘯ｿt API `PATCH /api/services/:id`: C蘯ｭp nh蘯ｭt ﾄ柁｡n giﾃ｡ ho蘯ｷc tr蘯｡ng thﾃ｡i t蘯｡m ng盻ｫng cung c蘯･p d盻議h v盻･.\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- Mﾃ｣ ngu盻渡: `backend/src/services-catalog/`.\\n- Tﾃｭch h盻｣p API v盻嬖 mﾃn hﾃｬnh ch盻肱 d盻議h v盻･ c盻ｧa Frontend.\\n\\n**Deadline:** 11/10/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm2GQ\",\"name\":\"type: feature\",\"description\":\"Ch盻ｩc nﾄハg m盻嬖\",\"color\":\"0075ca\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6NQ\",\"name\":\"owner: phuc\",\"description\":\"Phﾃｺc (Backend/API \u0026 DevOps)\",\"color\":\"e99695\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":114,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[Backend] BE-17: Phﾃ｡t tri盻ハ Module Services: API Qu蘯｣n lﾃｽ danh m盻･c gﾃｳi d盻議h v盻･ ti盻㌘ cﾆｰ盻嬖\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDODlJQCw\",\"login\":\"phucngo1707\",\"name\":\"\",\"databaseId\":240275467}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\r\\nPhﾃ｡t tri盻ハ Module Dishes \u0026 Menu: API Qu蘯｣n lﾃｽ danh m盻･c mﾃｳn ﾄハ vﾃ b盻・th盻ｱc ﾄ柁｡n ti盻㌘ cﾆｰ盻嬖.\\r\\n\\r\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\r\\n- [ ] T蘯｡o b蘯｣ng `dishes` vﾃ b蘯｣ng trung gian `menu_dishes` trong JPA Entity.\\r\\n- [ ] Vi蘯ｿt API `GET /api/dishes`: L蘯･y danh sﾃ｡ch mﾃｳn ﾄハ, h盻・tr盻｣ l盻皇 theo th盻・lo蘯｡i (Khai v盻・ Mﾃｳn chﾃｭnh, Trﾃ｡ng mi盻㌻g, ﾄ雪ｻ・u盻創g).\\r\\n- [ ] Vi蘯ｿt API `POST /api/menus`: T蘯｡o set menu m蘯ｫu m盻嬖 kﾃｨm danh sﾃ｡ch mﾃ｣ mﾃｳn ﾄハ vﾃ ﾄ柁｡n giﾃ｡ bﾃn tr盻肱 gﾃｳi.\\r\\n- [ ] Vi蘯ｿt API `GET /api/menus/:id`: Xem chi ti蘯ｿt cﾃ｡c mﾃｳn ﾄハ cﾃｳ trong m盻冲 set menu.\\r\\n\\r\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\r\\n- Mﾃ｣ ngu盻渡: `backend/src/dishes/` vﾃ `backend/src/menus/`.\\r\\n- Ki盻ノ tra cﾃ｡c endpoint ho蘯｡t ﾄ黛ｻ冢g chﾃｭnh xﾃ｡c trﾃｪn Postman.\\r\\n\\r\\n**Deadline:** 11/10/2026\\r\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm2GQ\",\"name\":\"type: feature\",\"description\":\"Ch盻ｩc nﾄハg m盻嬖\",\"color\":\"0075ca\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6NQ\",\"name\":\"owner: phuc\",\"description\":\"Phﾃｺc (Backend/API \u0026 DevOps)\",\"color\":\"e99695\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"descrip