ng theo vai trﾃｲ (Role-Based Access Control - RBAC) b蘯ｱng Spring Security.\\n\\n## 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n\\n* [x] C蘯･u hﾃｬnh Role-based Authorization v盻嬖 Spring Security\\n* [x] ﾄ雪ｻ杵h nghﾄｩa cﾃ｡c Role c盻ｧa h盻・th盻創g\\n* [x] ﾄ雪ｻ皇 Role t盻ｫ thﾃｴng tin ngﾆｰ盻拱 dﾃｹng sau khi xﾃ｡c th盻ｱc JWT\\n* [x] Phﾃ｢n quy盻］ truy c蘯ｭp theo Role cho API\\n* [x] Tr蘯｣ v盻・HTTP 403 Forbidden khi khﾃｴng ﾄ黛ｻｧ quy盻］\\n* [x] ﾃ｝ d盻･ng phﾃ｢n quy盻］ m蘯ｫu cho API qu蘯｣n lﾃｽ s蘯｣nh ti盻㌘\\n* [x] Ki盻ノ tra quy盻］ truy c蘯ｭp b蘯ｱng Postman\\n\\n## 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪\\n\\n* [x] C蘯･u hﾃｬnh RBAC trong `backend/`\\n* [x] Role Authorization ho蘯｡t ﾄ黛ｻ冢g v盻嬖 JWT\\n* [x] API ﾄ柁ｰ盻｣c b蘯｣o v盻・theo Role\\n* [x] X盻ｭ lﾃｽ l盻擁 403 ﾄ妥ｺng chu蘯ｩn JSON Response\\n* [x] Tﾃi li盻㎡ phﾃ｢n quy盻］ cho Frontend vﾃ QA\\n* [x] Pull Request vﾃo `develop`\\n\\n## 屏 Tech Stack\\n\\n* Java 21 LTS\\n* Spring Boot\\n* Spring Security\\n* JWT\\n* Maven\\n\\n## 側 Owner\\n\\nPhﾃｺc 窶・Backend/DevOps\\n\\n## 套 Deadline\\n\\n27/09/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm2GQ\",\"name\":\"type: feature\",\"description\":\"Ch盻ｩc nﾄハg m盻嬖\",\"color\":\"0075ca\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6NQ\",\"name\":\"owner: phuc\",\"description\":\"Phﾃｺc (Backend/API \u0026 DevOps)\",\"color\":\"e99695\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm8gQ\",\"name\":\"status: in-progress\",\"description\":\"ﾄ紳ng th盻ｱc hi盻㌻\",\"color\":\"ffa500\"}],\"number\":105,\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"[Backend] BE-08: Xﾃ｢y d盻ｱng RBAC phﾃ｢n quy盻］ ngﾆｰ盻拱 dﾃｹng\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDODlJQCw\",\"login\":\"phucngo1707\",\"name\":\"\",\"databaseId\":240275467}],\"body\":\"\\n\\n## 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\n\\nPhﾃ｡t tri盻ハ Module Auth cho phﾃｩp ﾄ惰ハg nh蘯ｭp, ki盻ノ tra m蘯ｭt kh蘯ｩu b蘯ｱng BCrypt vﾃ xﾃ｡c th盻ｱc b蘯ｱng JWT.\\n\\n## 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n\\n* [x] C蘯･u hﾃｬnh Spring Security vﾃ JWT\\n* [x] C蘯･u hﾃｬnh BCrypt Password Encoder\\n* [x] T蘯｡o Auth Controller vﾃ Auth Service\\n* [x] Xﾃ｢y d盻ｱng API `POST /api/v1/auth/login`\\n* [x] Ki盻ノ tra username/email vﾃ m蘯ｭt kh蘯ｩu\\n* [x] Sinh JWT Access Token sau khi ﾄ惰ハg nh蘯ｭp thﾃnh cﾃｴng\\n* [x] Xﾃ｡c th盻ｱc JWT t盻ｫ Header `Authorization: Bearer \u003ctoken\u003e`\\n* [x] X盻ｭ lﾃｽ ﾄ惰ハg nh蘯ｭp sai vﾃ token khﾃｴng h盻｣p l盻Ⅸn* [x] Ki盻ノ tra API ﾄ惰ハg nh蘯ｭp b蘯ｱng Postman\\n\\n## 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪\\n\\n* [x] Module Auth trong `backend/`\\n* [x] API `POST /api/v1/auth/login`\\n* [x] BCrypt Password Encoder ho蘯｡t ﾄ黛ｻ冢g\\n* [x] JWT Authentication ho蘯｡t ﾄ黛ｻ冢g\\n* [x] JSON Response ﾄ惰ハg nh蘯ｭp vﾃ l盻擁 ﾄ妥ｺng chu蘯ｩn\\n* [x] Pull Request vﾃo `develop`\\n\\n## 屏 Tech Stack\\n\\n* Java 21 LTS\\n* Spring Boot\\n* Spring Security\\n* JWT\\n* Jakarta Bean Validation\\n* Maven\\n\\n## 側 Owner\\n\\nPhﾃｺc 窶・Backend/DevOps\\n\\n## 套 Deadline\\n\\n27/09/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm2GQ\",\"name\":\"type: feature\",\"description\":\"Ch盻ｩc nﾄハg m盻嬖\",\"color\":\"0075ca\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6NQ\",\"name\":\"owner: phuc\",\"description\":\"Phﾃｺc (Backend/API \u0026 DevOps)\",\"color\":\"e99695\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm8gQ\",\"name\":\"status: in-progress\",\"description\":\"ﾄ紳ng th盻ｱc hi盻㌻\",\"color\":\"ffa500\"}],\"number\":104,\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"# [Backend] BE-07: Phﾃ｡t tri盻ハ Module Auth: ﾄ斉ハg nh蘯ｭp vﾃ JWT\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDODlJQCw\",\"login\":\"phucngo1707\",\"name\":\"\",\"databaseId\":240275467}],\"body\":\"## 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\n\\nC蘯･u hﾃｬnh cﾆ｡ ch蘯ｿ Validation toﾃn c盻･c ﾄ黛ｻ・ki盻ノ tra d盻ｯ li盻㎡ ﾄ黛ｺｧu vﾃo c盻ｧa DTO trong Backend Spring Boot.\\n\\n## 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n\\n* [x] C蘯･u hﾃｬnh Jakarta Bean Validation\\n* [x] S盻ｭ d盻･ng annotation Validation cho DTO\\n* [x] Kﾃｭch ho蘯｡t validation v盻嬖 `@Valid`\\n* [x] Ki盻ノ tra d盻ｯ li盻㎡ ﾄ黛ｺｧu vﾃo khﾃｴng h盻｣p l盻Ⅸn* [x] Chu蘯ｩn hﾃｳa thﾃｴng bﾃ｡o l盻擁 Validation\\n* [x] Tﾃｭch h盻｣p v盻嬖 Global Exception Handler\\n* [x] Ki盻ノ tra Validation trﾃｪn API m蘯ｫu\\n\\n## 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪\\n\\n* [x] C蘯･u hﾃｬnh Validation trong `backend/`\\n* [x] DTO m蘯ｫu cﾃｳ Validation\\n* [x] Validation ho蘯｡t ﾄ黛ｻ冢g v盻嬖 API\\n* [x] JSON Error Response khi d盻ｯ li盻㎡ khﾃｴng h盻｣p l盻Ⅸn* [x] Pull Request vﾃo `develop`\\n\\n## 屏 Tech Stack\\n\\n* Java 21 LTS\\n* Spring Boot\\n* Spring Web\\n* Jakarta Bean Validation\\n* Maven\\n\\n## 側 Owner\\n\\nPhﾃｺc 窶・Backend/DevOps\\n\\n## 套 Deadline\\n\\n20/09/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm2GQ\",\"name\":\"type: feature\",\"description\":\"Ch盻ｩc nﾄハg m盻嬖\",\"color\":\"0075ca\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6NQ\",\"name\":\"owner: phuc\",\"description\":\"Phﾃｺc (Backend/API \u0026 DevOps)\",\"color\":\"e99695\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Surxg\",\"name\":\"status: delayed\",\"description\":\"Cﾃｴng vi盻㌘ tr盻・h蘯｡n so v盻嬖 k蘯ｿ ho蘯｡ch\",\"color\":\"d73a4a\"}],\"number\":103,\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"[Backend] BE-06: C蘯･u hﾃｬnh Validation toﾃn c盻･c cho DTO\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDODlJQCw\",\"login\":\"phucngo1707\",\"name\":\"\",\"databaseId\":240275467}],\"body\":\"識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\n\\nXﾃ｢y d盻ｱng cﾆ｡ ch蘯ｿ x盻ｭ lﾃｽ Exception t蘯ｭp trung cho Backend Spring Boot vﾃ chu蘯ｩn hﾃｳa JSON Error Response.\\n\\n搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n\\nT蘯｡o Global Exception Handler b蘯ｱng @RestControllerAdvice\\n\\nX盻ｭ lﾃｽ cﾃ｡c l盻擁 HTTP ph盻・bi蘯ｿn\\n\\nX盻ｭ lﾃｽ l盻擁 Validation t盻ｫ @Valid\\n\\nX盻ｭ lﾃｽ l盻擁 Resource Not Found\\n\\nX盻ｭ lﾃｽ l盻擁 Conflict\\n\\nChu蘯ｩn hﾃｳa c蘯･u trﾃｺc JSON Error Response\\n\\nGhi log l盻擁 Server\\n\\nKi盻ノ tra cﾃ｡c API tr蘯｣ v盻・Error Response ﾄ妥ｺng format\\n\\n逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪\\n\\nGlobal Exception Handler trong backend/\\n\\nError Response DTO/Model\\n\\nCﾃ｡c l盻擁 ﾄ柁ｰ盻｣c x盻ｭ lﾃｽ t蘯ｭp trung\\n\\nAPI tr蘯｣ v盻・JSO