Ukznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":100,\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"[Backend] BE-03: C蘯･u hﾃｬnh Docker Compose mﾃｴi trﾆｰ盻拵g cﾆ｡ s盻・d盻ｯ li盻㎡ PostgreSQL c盻･c b盻・},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDODlJQCw\",\"login\":\"phucngo1707\",\"name\":\"\",\"databaseId\":240275467}],\"body\":\"# [Backend] BE-02: Thi蘯ｿt k蘯ｿ ki蘯ｿn trﾃｺc Modular Backend theo chu蘯ｩn Clean Architecture\\n\\n## 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\n\\nThi蘯ｿt k蘯ｿ ki蘯ｿn trﾃｺc Backend cho EVManager s盻ｭ d盻･ng **Java 21 + Spring Boot**, theo hﾆｰ盻嬾g Modular Architecture vﾃ Clean Architecture.\\n\\n## 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n\\n- [x] Phﾃ｢n chia cﾃ｡c module: Auth, Users, Customers, Venues, Events, Contracts, Payments, Reports.\\n- [x] Thi蘯ｿt k蘯ｿ ki蘯ｿn trﾃｺc Layer: Controller 竊・Service / Use Case 竊・Repository 竊・JPA / Hibernate 竊・PostgreSQL.\\n- [x] Chu蘯ｩn hﾃｳa RESTful API v盻嬖 prefix `/api/v1` vﾃ endpoint d蘯｡ng s盻・nhi盻「.\\n- [x] Chu蘯ｩn hﾃｳa HTTP Status Code: 200, 201, 400, 401, 403, 404, 409, 500.\\n- [x] Thi蘯ｿt k蘯ｿ c蘯･u trﾃｺc thﾆｰ m盻･c Backend phﾃｹ h盻｣p v盻嬖 Spring Boot.\\n- [x] ﾄ雪ｻ杵h hﾆｰ盻嬾g Validation vﾃ Exception Handling.\\n- [x] ﾄ雪ｻ杵h hﾆｰ盻嬾g Authentication/Authorization b蘯ｱng Spring Security + JWT.\\n\\n## 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪\\n\\n- [x] T蘯｡o tﾃi li盻㎡ `docs/design/backend-architecture.md`.\\n- [x] T蘯｡o sﾆ｡ ﾄ黛ｻ・ki蘯ｿn trﾃｺc Backend.\\n- [x] T蘯｡o sﾆ｡ ﾄ黛ｻ・cﾃ｡c module ﾄ黛ｻ・c蘯｣ nhﾃｳm tham kh蘯｣o.\\n\\n## 屏 Tech Stack\\n\\n- Java 21\\n- Spring Boot\\n- Spring Web\\n- Spring Data JPA + Hibernate\\n- PostgreSQL\\n- Flyway\\n- Spring Security + JWT\\n- Maven\\n\\n## 側 Owner\\n\\nPhﾃｺc 窶・Backend/DevOps\\n\\n**Deadline:** 13/09/2026\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm3Xg\",\"name\":\"type: docs\",\"description\":\"Tﾃi li盻㎡ d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n\",\"color\":\"e4e669\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6NQ\",\"name\":\"owner: phuc\",\"description\":\"Phﾃｺc (Backend/API \u0026 DevOps)\",\"color\":\"e99695\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"