FullCalendar cho qu蘯｣n lﾃｽ vﾃ hi盻ハ th盻・l盻議h s盻ｱ ki盻㌻.\\n- [x] ﾄ静｡nh giﾃ｡ JavaScript `fetch()` cho vi盻㌘ g盻絞 REST API t盻ｫ Backend.\\n\\n### 3. Kh蘯｣o sﾃ｡t Database vﾃ DevOps\\n\\n- [x] ﾄ静｡nh giﾃ｡ PostgreSQL cho d盻ｯ li盻㎡ quan h盻・c盻ｧa h盻・th盻創g.\\n- [x] ﾄ静｡nh giﾃ｡ kh蘯｣ nﾄハg x盻ｭ lﾃｽ d盻ｯ li盻㎡ quan h盻・ph盻ｩc t蘯｡p vﾃ JSON c盻ｧa PostgreSQL.\\n- [x] ﾄ静｡nh giﾃ｡ Docker + Docker Compose cho mﾃｴi trﾆｰ盻拵g phﾃ｡t tri盻ハ.\\n- [x] ﾄ静｡nh giﾃ｡ GitHub Actions cho CI/CD.\\n- [x] Th盻創g nh蘯･t Git + GitHub cho qu蘯｣n lﾃｽ mﾃ｣ ngu盻渡 vﾃ Pull Request.\\n\\n### 4. Th盻創g nh蘯･t Tech Stack\\n\\n- [x] Trao ﾄ黛ｻ品 v盻嬖 PM vﾃ BA.\\n- [x] Xﾃ｡c nh蘯ｭn Tech Stack chﾃｭnh th盻ｩc.\\n- [x] C蘯ｭp nh蘯ｭt tﾃi li盻㎡ ki蘯ｿn trﾃｺc k盻ｹ thu蘯ｭt.\\n- [x] ﾄ雪ｺ｣m b蘯｣o cﾃ｡c Issue Backend/Frontend ti蘯ｿp theo s盻ｭ d盻･ng ﾄ妥ｺng Tech Stack ﾄ妥｣ th盻創g nh蘯･t.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n\\n- [x] Tﾃi li盻㎡ `docs/design/tech-stack.md`.\\n- [x] Tﾃi li盻㎡ mﾃｴ t蘯｣ ki蘯ｿn trﾃｺc k盻ｹ thu蘯ｭt c盻ｧa h盻・th盻創g.\\n- [x] Danh sﾃ｡ch Tech Stack chﾃｭnh th盻ｩc.\\n- [x] Ghi nh蘯ｭn quy蘯ｿt ﾄ黛ｻ杵h cﾃｴng ngh盻・vﾃo h盻・sﾆ｡ d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 女・・Ki蘯ｿn trﾃｺc h盻・th盻創g\\n\\n```text\\nHTML\\nCSS\\nJavaScript\\nBootstrap 5\\nChart.js\\nFullCalendar\\n        笏・n        笏・fetch()\\n        笆ｼ\\nSpring Boot REST API\\n        笏・n        笏懌楳笏 Spring Web\\n        笏懌楳笏 Spring Security + JWT\\n        笏懌楳笏 Spring Data JPA\\n        笏懌楳笏 Hibernate\\n        笏披楳笏 Flyway\\n        笏・n        笆ｼ\\nPostgreSQL\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm4Iw\",\"name\":\"type: chore\",\"description\":\"Setup, c蘯･u hﾃｬnh, tooling\",\"color\":\"e4e4e4\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6NQ\",\"name\":\"owner: phuc\",\"description\":\"Phﾃｺc (Backend/API \u0026 DevOps)\",\"color\":\"e99695\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":98,\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"[Backend] BE-01: Kh蘯｣o sﾃ｡t vﾃ l盻ｱa ch盻肱 cﾃｴng ngh盻・Backend: NestJS, TypeScript, P