ch盻穎h (Final Project Management Report)\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDOEP5Lkg\",\"login\":\"plhhoang2005\",\"name\":\"Hoang Pham\",\"databaseId\":285100946}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nﾄ進盻「 ph盻訴 phiﾃｪn ch蘯｡y th盻ｭ nghi盻㍊ UAT th盻ｱc t蘯ｿ, ghi nh蘯ｭn cﾃ｡c ph蘯｣n h盻妬 vﾃ kﾃｽ biﾃｪn b蘯｣n xﾃ｡c nh蘯ｭn l盻擁 t盻渡 ﾄ黛ｻ肱g.\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] Ch盻ｧ trﾃｬ bu盻品 ch蘯｡y th盻ｭ nghi盻㍊ UAT theo k盻議h b蘯｣n 15 tﾃｬnh hu盻創g nghi盻㎝ v盻･ th盻ｱc t蘯ｿ.\\n- [ ] Ghi nh蘯ｭn danh sﾃ｡ch cﾃ｡c l盻擁 phﾃ｡t sinh ngoﾃi d盻ｱ ki蘯ｿn vﾃ phﾃ｢n lo蘯｡i m盻ｩc ﾄ黛ｻ・nghiﾃｪm tr盻肱g (Severity 1-4).\\n- [ ] Yﾃｪu c蘯ｧu ﾄ黛ｻ冓 ngﾅｩ k盻ｹ thu蘯ｭt cam k蘯ｿt th盻拱 gian s盻ｭa d盻ｩt ﾄ訴盻ノ cﾃ｡c l盻擁 Critical/High trﾆｰ盻嫩 ngﾃy 28/10.\\n- [ ] L蘯ｭp Biﾃｪn b蘯｣n xﾃ｡c nh蘯ｭn k蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ ch蘯｡y th盻ｭ nghi盻㍊ UAT cﾃｳ ﾄ黛ｺｧy ﾄ黛ｻｧ ch盻ｯ kﾃｽ cﾃ｡c bﾃｪn.\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- Biﾃｪn b蘯｣n UAT chﾃｭnh th盻ｩc lﾆｰu t蘯｡i `docs/meetings/uat-session-report.md`.\\n- ﾄ斉ハg t蘯｣i biﾃｪn b蘯｣n lﾃｪn h盻・sﾆ｡ nghi盻㍊ thu d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n.\\n\\n**Deadline:** 25/10/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm3Xg\",\"name\":\"type: docs\",\"description\":\"Tﾃi li盻㎡ d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n\",\"color\":\"e4e669\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm4ug\",\"name\":\"owner: hoang\",\"description\":\"Hoﾃng (PM / Scrum Master)\",\"color\":\"1d76db\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":33,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[PM] PM-27: Giﾃ｡m sﾃ｡t ﾄ黛ｻ｣t ch蘯｡y th盻ｭ nghi盻㍊ UAT vﾃ kﾃｽ biﾃｪn b蘯｣n xﾃ｡c nh蘯ｭn l盻擁 t盻渡 ﾄ黛ｻ肱g\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDOEP5Lkg\",\"login\":\"plhhoang2005\",\"name\":\"Hoang Pham\",\"databaseId\":285100946}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nXﾃ｢y d盻ｱng K蘯ｿ ho蘯｡ch nghi盻㍊ thu ngﾆｰ盻拱 dﾃｹng (UAT Plan) vﾃ chu蘯ｩn b盻・cﾃ｡c th盻ｧ t盻･c bﾃn giao s蘯｣n ph蘯ｩm ph蘯ｧn m盻［.\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] Xﾃ｡c ﾄ黛ｻ杵h ph蘯｡m vi nghi盻㍊ thu UAT: Ki盻ノ tra toﾃn b盻・14 Use Cases trﾃｪn mﾃｴi trﾆｰ盻拵g Staging/Cloud.\\n- [ ] Lﾃｪn l盻議h trﾃｬnh ch蘯｡y th盻ｭ nghi盻㍊ UAT v盻嬖 ﾄ黛ｺ｡i di盻㌻ khﾃ｡ch hﾃng/ngﾆｰ盻拱 dﾃｹng gi蘯｣ ﾄ黛ｻ杵h.\\n- [ ] Chu蘯ｩn b盻・cﾃ｡c biﾃｪn b蘯｣n nghi盻㍊ thu: Biﾃｪn b蘯｣n bﾃn giao k盻ｹ thu蘯ｭt, biﾃｪn b蘯｣n ﾄ妥o t蘯｡o ngﾆｰ盻拱 dﾃｹng.\\n- [ ] Thﾃnh l蘯ｭp ban nghi盻㍊ thu g盻杜: PM, Khﾃ｡ch hﾃng, Trﾆｰ盻殤g nhﾃｳm k盻ｹ thu蘯ｭt vﾃ QA.\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- K蘯ｿ ho蘯｡ch nghi盻㍊ thu lﾆｰu t蘯｡i `docs/planning/uat-plan.md`.\\n- Bi盻ブ m蘯ｫu biﾃｪn b蘯｣n nghi盻㍊ thu `docs/planning/acceptance-form-template.md`.\\n\\n**Deadline:** 25/10/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm3Xg\",\"name\":\"type: docs\",\"description\":\"Tﾃi li盻㎡ d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n\",\"color\":\"e4e669\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm4ug\",\"name\":\"owner: hoang\",\"description\":\"Hoﾃng (PM / Scrum Master)\",\"color\":\"1d76db\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":32,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[PM] PM-26: Xﾃ｢y d盻ｱng K蘯ｿ ho蘯｡ch chuy盻ハ giao vﾃ Nghi盻㍊ thu ngﾆｰ盻拱 dﾃｹng (UAT Plan)\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDOEP5Lkg\",\"login\":\"plhhoang2005\",\"name\":\"Hoang Pham\",\"databaseId\":285100946}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nPhﾃ｢n tﾃｭch s盻・li盻㎡ l盻擁 ph蘯ｧn m盻［ b蘯ｱng Bi盻ブ ﾄ黛ｻ・Pareto 80/20 vﾃ ﾄ黛ｻ・xu蘯･t k蘯ｿ ho蘯｡ch kh蘯ｯc ph盻･c ch蘯･t lﾆｰ盻｣ng.\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] Thu th蘯ｭp d盻ｯ li盻㎡ l盻擁 t盻ｫ Defect Log c盻ｧa QA (cﾃ｡c nhﾃｳm l盻擁: Tﾃｭnh toﾃ｡n sai, L盻㌘h mﾃｺi gi盻・ Trﾃｹng l盻議h, Giao di盻㌻...).\\n- [ ] Tﾃｭnh s盻・l蘯ｧn xu蘯･t hi盻㌻, t盻ｷ l盻・% chi蘯ｿm vﾃ t盻ｷ l盻・% tﾃｭch lﾅｩy c盻ｧa t盻ｫng lo蘯｡i l盻擁.\\n- [ ] V蘯ｽ Bi盻ブ ﾄ黛ｻ・Pareto c盻冲 k蘯ｿt h盻｣p ﾄ柁ｰ盻拵g tﾃｭch lﾅｩy (Cumulative line 80%).\\n- [ ] Ch盻・ra 20% nhﾃｳm l盻擁 tr盻肱g y蘯ｿu c蘯ｧn t蘯ｭp trung kh蘯ｯc ph盻･c ngay l蘯ｭp t盻ｩc trﾆｰ盻嫩 khi release.\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- Tﾃi li盻㎡ phﾃ｢n tﾃｭch Pareto trong `docs/planning/pareto-quality-analysis.md`.\\n- File 蘯｣nh bi盻ブ ﾄ黛ｻ・Pareto `docs/planning/pareto-chart.png`.\\n\\n**Deadline:** 18/10/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAA