蘯･p nh蘯ｭn\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDOEP5Lkg\",\"login\":\"plhhoang2005\",\"name\":\"Hoang Pham\",\"databaseId\":285100946}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nﾄ静｡nh giﾃ｡ l盻ｱa ch盻肱 nhﾃ cung c蘯･p d盻議h v盻･ h蘯｡ t蘯ｧng vﾃ qu蘯｣n lﾃｽ h盻｣p ﾄ黛ｻ渡g mua s蘯ｯm d盻議h v盻･ ﾄ妥｡m mﾃ｢y.\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] Thi蘯ｿt l蘯ｭp cﾃ｡c tiﾃｪu chﾃｭ ﾄ妥｡nh giﾃ｡ nhﾃ cung c蘯･p: ﾄ雪ｻ・s蘯ｵn sﾃng 99.9%, h盻・tr盻｣ PostgreSQL, chi phﾃｭ sinh viﾃｪn.\\n- [ ] Ch盻肱 ﾄ柁｡n v盻・cung c蘯･p d盻議h v盻･ Database Hosting (Supabase / Neon) vﾃ Web Hosting (Vercel).\\n- [ ] ﾄ斉ハg kﾃｽ tﾃi kho蘯｣n vﾃ lﾆｰu tr盻ｯ c蘯･u hﾃｬnh b蘯｣o m蘯ｭt vﾃo bi蘯ｿn mﾃｴi trﾆｰ盻拵g an toﾃn.\\n- [ ] Theo dﾃｵi hﾃｳa ﾄ柁｡n chi tiﾃｪu th盻ｱc t蘯ｿ ﾄ黛ｻ訴 chi蘯ｿu v盻嬖 d盻ｱ toﾃ｡n ban ﾄ黛ｺｧu.\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- B蘯｣ng ﾄ妥｡nh giﾃ｡ nhﾃ cung c蘯･p `docs/planning/vendor-evaluation.md`.\\n- Bﾃn giao thﾃｴng s盻・mﾃｴi trﾆｰ盻拵g cho Phﾃｺc (DevOps) c蘯･u hﾃｬnh tri盻ハ khai.\\n\\n**Deadline:** 11/10/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm3Xg\",\"name\":\"type: docs\",\"description\":\"Tﾃi li盻㎡ d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n\",\"color\":\"e4e669\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm4ug\",\"name\":\"owner: hoang\",\"description\":\"Hoﾃng (PM / Scrum Master)\",\"color\":\"1d76db\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm7VA\",\"name\":\"priority: medium\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn trung bﾃｬnh\",\"color\":\"fbca04\"}],\"number\":29,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[PM] PM-23: ﾄ静｡nh giﾃ｡ bﾃ｡o giﾃ｡ vﾃ l盻ｱa ch盻肱 nhﾃ cung c蘯･p d盻議h v盻･ h蘯｡ t蘯ｧng Server/Email\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDOEP5Lkg\",\"login\":\"plhhoang2005\",\"name\":\"Hoang Pham\",\"databaseId\":285100946}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nXﾃ｢y d盻ｱng K蘯ｿ ho蘯｡ch mua s蘯ｯm d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n (Procurement Management Plan) theo Chﾆｰﾆ｡ng 9 c盻ｧa Baocao.pdf.\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] Phﾃ｢n tﾃｭch bﾃi toﾃ｡n T盻ｱ lﾃm hay Mua/Thuﾃｪ ngoﾃi (Make-or-Buy Analysis) cho: Server, Domain, Email API.\\n- [ ] L蘯ｭp danh sﾃ｡ch cﾃ｡c d盻議h v盻･ c蘯ｧn thuﾃｪ: Mﾃ｡y ch盻ｧ Cloud (Render/AWS), Tﾃｪn mi盻］, D盻議h v盻･ g盻ｭi mail t盻ｱ ﾄ黛ｻ冢g.\\n- [ ] Kh蘯｣o sﾃ｡t ﾄ柁｡n giﾃ｡ thuﾃｪ theo thﾃ｡ng vﾃ so sﾃ｡nh v盻嬖 phﾆｰﾆ｡ng ﾃ｡n t盻ｱ v蘯ｭn hﾃnh mﾃ｡y ch盻ｧ v蘯ｭt lﾃｽ.\\n- [ ] ﾄ脆ｰa ra quy蘯ｿt ﾄ黛ｻ杵h t盻訴 ﾆｰu ngﾃ｢n sﾃ｡ch cho ﾄ黛ｻ・tﾃi mﾃｴn h盻皇.\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- Tﾃi li盻㎡ `docs/planning/procurement-plan.md` g盻杜 b蘯｣ng so sﾃ｡nh Make-or-Buy.\\n- PM phﾃｪ duy盻㏄ ngﾃ｢n sﾃ｡ch mua s蘯ｯm d盻議h v盻･.\\n\\n**Deadline:** 11/10/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm3Xg\",\"name\":\"type: docs\",\"description\":\"Tﾃi li盻㎡ d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n\",\"color\":\"e4e669\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm4ug\",\"name\":\"owner: hoang\",\"description\":\"Hoﾃng (PM / Scrum Master)\",\"color\":\"1d76db\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm7VA\",\"name\":\"priority: medium\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn trung bﾃｬnh\",\"color\":\"fbca04\"}],\"number\":28,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[PM] PM-22: L蘯ｭp K蘯ｿ ho蘯｡ch mua s蘯ｯm (Procurement Plan: Make-or-Buy analysis cho Cloud/Mail)\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDOEP5Lkg\",\"login\":\"plhhoang2005\",\"name\":\"Hoang Pham\",\"databaseId\":285100946}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nTi蘯ｿp nh蘯ｭn ph蘯｣n h盻妬 sau bu盻品 Demo gi盻ｯa k盻ｳ vﾃ th盻ｱc hi盻㌻ quy trﾃｬnh Qu蘯｣n lﾃｽ thay ﾄ黛ｻ品 (Change Request CR-01).\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] Ghi chﾃｩp toﾃn b盻・nh蘯ｭn xﾃｩt, gﾃｳp ﾃｽ c盻ｧa Th蘯ｧy cﾃｴ vﾃ H盻冓 ﾄ黛ｻ渡g ﾄ妥｡nh giﾃ｡ gi盻ｯa k盻ｳ.\\n- [ ] L蘯ｭp Phi蘯ｿu yﾃｪu c蘯ｧu thay ﾄ黛ｻ品 (CR-01): Mﾃｴ t蘯｣ n盻冓 dung thay ﾄ黛ｻ品, lﾃｽ do vﾃ ph蘯｡m vi 蘯｣nh hﾆｰ盻殤g.\\n- [ ] ﾄ静｡nh giﾃ｡ tﾃ｡c ﾄ黛ｻ冢g c盻ｧa CR-01 ﾄ黛ｺｿn ti蘯ｿn ﾄ黛ｻ・ﾄ柁ｰ盻拵g gﾄハg vﾃ ngﾃ｢n sﾃ｡ch d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n.\\n- [ ] Cﾃｹng c蘯｣ nhﾃｳm kﾃｽ duy盻㏄ ch蘯･p thu蘯ｭn th盻ｱc thi thay ﾄ黛ｻ品 vﾃ c蘯ｭp nh蘯ｭt vﾃo Product Backlog.\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- Phi蘯ｿu yﾃｪu c蘯ｧu thay ﾄ黛ｻ品 `docs/planning/change-request-CR01.md`.\\n- C蘯ｭp nh蘯ｭt log thay ﾄ黛ｻ品 trong `docs/agentflow/DECISION_LOG.md`.\\n\\n**Deadline:** 04/10/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm3Xg\",\"name\":\"type: docs\",\"description\":\"Tﾃi li盻㎡ d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n\",\"color\":\"e4e669\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm4ug\",\"name\":\"owner: hoang\",\"description\":\"Hoﾃng (PM / Scrum Master)\",\"color\":\"1d76db\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm7VA\",\"name\":\"priority: medium\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn trung bﾃｬnh\",\"color\":\"fbca04\"}],\"number\":27,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[PM] PM-21: Ti蘯ｿp nh蘯ｭn vﾃ x盻ｭ lﾃｽ Yﾃｪu c蘯ｧu thay ﾄ黛ｻ品 CR-01 sau bu盻品 Demo gi盻ｯa k盻ｳ\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDOEP5Lkg\",\"login\":\"plhhoang2005\",\"name\":\"Hoang Pham\",\"databaseId\":285100946}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nChu蘯ｩn b盻・k盻議h b蘯｣n thuy蘯ｿt trﾃｬnh vﾃ slide bﾃ｡o cﾃ｡o t盻貧g k蘯ｿt giai ﾄ双蘯｡n 1 (Demo gi盻ｯa k盻ｳ 50%).\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] So蘯｡n th蘯｣o slide bﾃ｡o cﾃ｡o: Gi盻嬖 thi盻㎡ ﾄ黛ｻ・tﾃi, h盻・sﾆ｡ Charter, WBS, sﾆ｡ ﾄ黛ｻ・PERT, s盻・li盻㎡ EVM vﾃ demo ch蘯｡y th盻ｭ.\\n- [ ] Lﾃｪn k盻議h b蘯｣n Demo 50% theo lu盻渡g nghi盻㎝ v盻･: ﾄ斉ハg nh蘯ｭp -\u003e Qu蘯｣n lﾃｽ khﾃ｡ch hﾃng -\u003e Tra c盻ｩu s蘯｣nh ti盻㌘.\\n- [ ] T盻・ch盻ｩc t盻貧g duy盻㏄ (Rehearsal) trﾆｰ盻嫩 bu盻品 bﾃ｡o cﾃ｡o chﾃｭnh th盻ｩc v盻嬖 Gi蘯｣ng viﾃｪn.\\n- [ ] Phﾃ｢n chia ngﾆｰ盻拱 trﾃｬnh bﾃy ph蘯ｧn qu蘯｣n lﾃｽ (PM, BA) vﾃ ph蘯ｧn k盻ｹ thu蘯ｭt (Dev, QA).\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- T盻㎝ trﾃｬnh chi蘯ｿu slide `docs/meetings/Midterm_Presentation_EVManager.pptx`.\\n- K盻議h b蘯｣n demo chi ti蘯ｿt lﾆｰu t蘯｡i `docs/meetings/midterm-demo-script.md`.\\n\\n**Deadline:** 04/10/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm3Xg\",\"name\":\"type: docs\",\"description\":\"Tﾃi li盻㎡ d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n\",\"color\":\"e4e669\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm4ug\",\"name\":\"owner: hoang\",\"description\":\"Hoﾃng (PM / Scrum Master)\",\"color\":\"1d76db\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":26,\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"[PM] PM-20: Chu蘯ｩn b盻・K盻議h b蘯｣n vﾃ Slide thuy蘯ｿt trﾃｬnh Demo gi盻ｯa k盻ｳ 50%\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDOEP5Lkg\",\"login\":\"plhhoang2005\",\"name\":\"Hoang Pham\",\"databaseId\":285100946}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nBiﾃｪn so蘯｡n b蘯｣n phﾃ｢n tﾃｭch nguyﾃｪn nhﾃ｢n sai l盻㌘h EVM vﾃ l蘯ｭp k蘯ｿ ho蘯｡ch ﾄ訴盻「 ch盻穎h chi phﾃｭ/ti蘯ｿn ﾄ黛ｻ・cho n盻ｭa sau d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n.\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] Phﾃ｢n tﾃｭch nguyﾃｪn nhﾃ｢n c盻･ th盻・d蘯ｫn ﾄ黛ｺｿn $CV \u003c 0$ (kho蘯｣n chﾃｪnh l盻㌘h chi phﾃｭ phﾃ｡t sinh).\\n- [ ] Phﾃ｢n tﾃｭch lﾃｽ do cﾃ｡c task Backend vﾃ QA lﾃm gi蘯｣m ch盻・s盻・ti蘯ｿn ﾄ黛ｻ・$SPI$.\\n- [ ] ﾄ脆ｰa ra gi蘯｣i phﾃ｡p: Tﾄハg gi盻・lﾃm vi盻㌘ t蘯ｭp trung, ki盻ノ soﾃ｡t ch蘯ｷt cﾃ｡c kho蘯｣n chi h蘯｡ t蘯ｧng ngoﾃi.\\n- [ ] D盻ｱ bﾃ｡o t盻貧g chi phﾃｭ khi hoﾃn thﾃnh d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n ($EAC = BAC / CPI$).\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- Bﾃ｡o cﾃ｡o gi蘯｣i trﾃｬnh EVM lﾆｰu t蘯｡i `docs/planning/evm-variance-report.md`.\\n- ﾄ脆ｰa n盻冓 dung phﾃ｢n tﾃｭch vﾃo slide bﾃ｡o cﾃ｡o gi盻ｯa k盻ｳ.\\n\\n**Deadline:** 04/10/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm3Xg\",\"name\":\"type: docs\",\"description\":\"Tﾃi li盻㎡ d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n\",\"color\":\"e4e669\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm4ug\",\"name\":\"owner: hoang\",\"description\":\"Hoﾃng (PM / Scrum Master)\",\"color\":\"1d76db\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":25,\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"[PM] PM-19: Phﾃ｢n tﾃｭch nguyﾃｪn nhﾃ｢n chﾃｪnh l盻㌘h chi phﾃｭ vﾃ th盻拱 gian d盻ｱa trﾃｪn ch盻・s盻・EVM\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDOEP5Lkg\",\"login\":\"plhhoang2005\",\"name\":\"Hoang Pham\",\"databaseId\":285100946}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nTﾃｭnh toﾃ｡n cﾃ｡c ch盻・s盻・Qu蘯｣n lﾃｽ giﾃ｡ tr盻・thu ﾄ柁ｰ盻｣c (EVM: BCWS, BCWP, ACWP, CV, SV, CPI, SPI) t蘯｡i m盻祖 ngﾃy th盻ｩ 20 c盻ｧa d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n.\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] Thu th蘯ｭp s盻・li盻㎡ th盻ｱc t蘯ｿ t蘯｡i ngﾃy th盻ｩ 20: T盻ｷ l盻・% hoﾃn thﾃnh th盻ｱc t蘯ｿ vﾃ chi phﾃｭ th盻ｱc t蘯ｿ ﾄ妥｣ chi (ACWP).\\n- [ ] Tﾃｭnh Giﾃ｡ tr盻・theo k蘯ｿ ho蘯｡ch: $BCWS = Plan Cost \\\\times \\\\% Plan for Now$.\\n- [ ] Tﾃｭnh Giﾃ｡ tr盻・thu ﾄ柁ｰ盻｣c: $BCWP = Plan Cost \\\\times \\\\% Actual Complete$.\\n- [ ] Tﾃｭnh Chﾃｪnh l盻㌘h chi phﾃｭ $CV = BCWP - ACWP$ vﾃ Chﾃｪnh l盻㌘h ti蘯ｿn ﾄ黛ｻ・$SV = BCWP - BCWS$.\\n- [ ] Tﾃｭnh Ch盻・s盻・hi盻㎡ nﾄハg chi phﾃｭ $CPI = BCWP / ACWP$ vﾃ ti蘯ｿn ﾄ黛ｻ・$SPI = BCWP / BCWS$.\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- B蘯｣ng tﾃｭnh EVM chi ti蘯ｿt trong file Excel `docs/planning/EVM_Analysis_Day20.xlsx`.\\n- B蘯｣n bﾃ｡o cﾃ｡o gi蘯｣i trﾃｬnh s盻・li盻㎡ EVM kﾃｨm k蘯ｿt lu蘯ｭn: $SPI \u003c 1$ (d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n tr盻・ vﾃ $CPI \u003c 1$ (chi quﾃ｡ ngﾃ｢n sﾃ｡ch).\\n\\n**Deadline:** 04/10/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm3Xg\",\"name\":\"type: docs\",\"description\":\"Tﾃi li盻㎡ d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n\",\"color\":\"e4e669\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm4ug\",\"name\":\"owner: hoang\",\"description\":\"Hoﾃng (PM / Scrum Master)\",\"color\":\"1d76db\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":24,\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"[PM] PM-18: Tﾃｭnh toﾃ｡n cﾃ｡c ch盻・s盻・EVM (BCWS, BCWP, ACWP, CV, SV, CPI, SPI) t蘯｡i ngﾃy 20\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDOEP5Lkg\",\"login\":\"plhhoang2005\",\"name\":\"Hoang Pham\",\"databaseId\":285100946}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nT盻・ch盻ｩc h盻膏 ki盻ノ ﾄ訴盻ノ Tu蘯ｧn 3: Rﾃ soﾃ｡t vi盻㌘ kh蘯ｯc ph盻･c cﾃ｡c task tr盻・h蘯｡n vﾃ chu蘯ｩn b盻・Demo 50%.\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] Ki盻ノ tra vi盻㌘ n盻冪 code Backend c盻ｧa Phﾃｺc vﾃ giao di盻㌻ ﾄ斉ハg nh蘯ｭp c盻ｧa Nhﾃ｢n.\\n- [ ] Xﾃ｡c nh蘯ｭn cﾃ｡c task tr盻・h蘯｡n ﾄ妥｣ ﾄ柁ｰ盻｣c gi蘯｣i quy蘯ｿt ho蘯ｷc chuy盻ハ tr蘯｡ng thﾃ｡i sang In-Progress.\\n- [ ] Phﾃ｢n cﾃｴng c盻･ th盻・k盻議h b蘯｣n ch蘯｡y Demo 50% gi盻ｯa k盻ｳ cho t盻ｫng ngﾆｰ盻拱.\\n- [ ] L蘯ｭp Biﾃｪn b蘯｣n cu盻冂 h盻膏 s盻・03 ghi nh蘯ｭn cam k蘯ｿt ti蘯ｿn ﾄ黛ｻ・c盻ｧa nhﾃｳm.\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- Biﾃｪn b蘯｣n cu盻冂 h盻膏 lﾆｰu t蘯｡i `docs/meetings/meeting-03-week3.md`.\\n- C蘯ｭp nh蘯ｭt nhﾃ｣n tr蘯｡ng thﾃ｡i c盻ｧa cﾃ｡c issue trﾃｪn GitHub.\\n\\n**Deadline:** 27/09/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm3Xg\",\"name\":\"type: docs\",\"description\":\"Tﾃi li盻㎡ d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n\",\"color\":\"e4e669\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm4ug\",\"name\":\"owner: hoang\",\"description\":\"Hoﾃng (PM / Scrum Master)\",\"color\":\"1d76db\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm7VA\",\"name\":\"priority: medium\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn trung bﾃｬnh\",\"color\":\"fbca04\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm8gQ\",\"name\":\"status: in-progress\",\"description\":\"ﾄ紳ng th盻ｱc hi盻㌻\",\"color\":\"ffa500\"}],\"number\":23,\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"[PM] PM-17: Biﾃｪn b蘯｣n h盻膏 tu蘯ｧn 3: Rﾃ soﾃ｡t cﾃ｡c task tr盻・h蘯｡n vﾃ chu蘯ｩn b盻・Demo 50%\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDOEP5Lkg\",\"login\":\"plhhoang2005\",\"name\":\"Hoang Pham\",\"databaseId\":285100946}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nﾄ静｡nh giﾃ｡ m盻ｩc ﾄ黛ｻ・l盻㌘h ti蘯ｿn ﾄ黛ｻ・cu盻訴 Tu蘯ｧn 2 vﾃ ﾃ｡p d盻･ng k盻ｹ thu蘯ｭt Fast-tracking (th盻ｱc hi盻㌻ song song) ﾄ黛ｻ・kﾃｩo l蘯｡i ti蘯ｿn ﾄ黛ｻ・d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n.\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] Rﾃ soﾃ｡t 8 task b盻・tr盻・h蘯｡n 盻・Tu蘯ｧn 2 c盻ｧa Backend, Frontend vﾃ QA.\\n- [ ] ﾄ進盻「 chuy盻ハ nhﾃ｢n l盻ｱc: Phﾃ｢n cﾃｴng BA (Hi盻ハ) h盻・tr盻｣ QA chu蘯ｩn b盻・test case vﾃ d盻ｯ li盻㎡ m蘯ｫu.\\n- [ ] Yﾃｪu c蘯ｧu Backend (Phﾃｺc) vﾃ Frontend (Nhﾃ｢n) th盻創g nh蘯･t h盻｣p ﾄ黛ｻ渡g API DTO ﾄ黛ｻ・code song song.\\n- [ ] C蘯ｭp nh蘯ｭt l蘯｡i k蘯ｿ ho蘯｡ch chi ti蘯ｿt hﾃng ngﾃy c盻ｧa Tu蘯ｧn 3 ﾄ黛ｻ・ﾄ黛ｺ｣m b蘯｣o k盻却 m盻祖 Demo gi盻ｯa k盻ｳ.\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- Tﾃi li盻㎡ bﾃ｡o cﾃ｡o kh蘯ｯc ph盻･c ti蘯ｿn ﾄ黛ｻ・`docs/planning/fast-tracking-plan.md`.\\n- G盻ｭi c蘯｣nh bﾃ｡o ti蘯ｿn ﾄ黛ｻ・cho cﾃ｡c thﾃnh viﾃｪn ph盻･ trﾃ｡ch task tr盻・h蘯｡n.\\n\\n**Deadline:** 27/09/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm3Xg\",\"name\":\"type: docs\",\"description\":\"Tﾃi li盻㎡ d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n\",\"color\":\"e4e669\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm4ug\",\"name\":\"owner: hoang\",\"description\":\"Hoﾃng (PM / Scrum Master)\",\"color\":\"1d76db\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":22,\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"[PM] PM-16: ﾄ静｡nh giﾃ｡ m盻ｩc ﾄ黛ｻ・l盻㌘h ti蘯ｿn ﾄ黛ｻ・cu盻訴 tu蘯ｧn 2 vﾃ l蘯ｭp phﾆｰﾆ｡ng ﾃ｡n bﾃｹ ti蘯ｿn ﾄ黛ｻ・(Fast-tracking)\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDOEP5Lkg\",\"login\":\"plhhoang2005\",\"name\":\"Hoang Pham\",\"databaseId\":285100946}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nXﾃ｢y d盻ｱng K蘯ｿ ho蘯｡ch 盻ｩng phﾃｳ r盻ｧi ro theo 4 chi蘯ｿn lﾆｰ盻｣c kinh ﾄ訴盻ハ: Trﾃ｡nh (Avoid), Chuy盻ハ giao (Transfer), Gi蘯｣m nh蘯ｹ (Mitigate), Ch蘯･p nh蘯ｭn (Accept).\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] ﾄ雪ｻ・xu蘯･t phﾆｰﾆ｡ng ﾃ｡n gi蘯｣m nh蘯ｹ (Mitigate) cho r盻ｧi ro: Thﾃnh viﾃｪn ngh盻・vi盻㌘ ho蘯ｷc ch蘯ｭm ti蘯ｿn ﾄ黛ｻ・\\n- [ ] ﾄ雪ｻ・xu蘯･t phﾆｰﾆ｡ng ﾃ｡n trﾃ｡nh (Avoid) cho r盻ｧi ro: L盻擁 tﾃｭnh sai chi蘯ｿt kh蘯･u ho蘯ｷc ﾄ黛ｺｷt trﾃｹng l盻議h s蘯｣nh.\\n- [ ] ﾄ雪ｻ・xu蘯･t phﾆｰﾆ｡ng ﾃ｡n chuy盻ハ giao (Transfer) cho r盻ｧi ro: S盻ｱ c盻・h蘯｡ t蘯ｧng cloud ho蘯ｷc m蘯｡ng internet.\\n- [ ] Xﾃ｡c ﾄ黛ｻ杵h ngﾃ｢n sﾃ｡ch d盻ｱ phﾃｲng (Contingency Reserve) vﾃ k蘯ｿ ho蘯｡ch d盻ｱ phﾃｲng kh蘯ｩn c蘯･p.\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- Tﾃi li盻㎡ `docs/planning/risk-response-plan.md`.\\n- PM ph盻・bi蘯ｿn cﾃ｡c quy t蘯ｯc 盻ｩng phﾃｳ cho toﾃn b盻・thﾃnh viﾃｪn.\\n\\n**Deadline:** 27/09/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm3Xg\",\"name\":\"type: docs\",\"description\":\"Tﾃi li盻㎡ d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n\",\"color\":\"e4e669\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm4ug\",\"name\":\"owner: hoang\",\"description\":\"Hoﾃng (PM / Scrum Master)\",\"color\":\"1d76db\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":21,\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"[PM] PM-15: Xﾃ｢y d盻ｱng K蘯ｿ ho蘯｡ch 盻ｩng phﾃｳ r盻ｧi ro theo chi蘯ｿn lﾆｰ盻｣c 4T (Trﾃ｡nh, Chuy盻ハ, Gi蘯｣m, Nh蘯ｭn)\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDOEP5Lkg\",\"login\":\"plhhoang2005\",\"name\":\"Hoang Pham\",\"databaseId\":285100946}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nL蘯ｭp B蘯｣ng ﾄ惰ハg kﾃｽ r盻ｧi ro (Risk Register) toﾃn di盻㌻ theo m蘯ｫu Chﾆｰﾆ｡ng 8 c盻ｧa Baocao.pdf ﾄ黛ｻ・ch盻ｧ ﾄ黛ｻ冢g phﾃｲng ng盻ｫa s盻ｱ c盻・\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] H盻膏 Brainstorming v盻嬖 c蘯｣ 4 thﾃnh viﾃｪn ﾄ黛ｻ・nh蘯ｭn di盻㌻ t盻訴 thi盻ブ 10 r盻ｧi ro th盻ｱc t蘯ｿ.\\n- [ ] ﾄ静｡nh giﾃ｡ Xﾃ｡c su蘯･t (P: 10% - 50%) vﾃ M盻ｩc ﾄ黛ｻ・蘯｣nh hﾆｰ盻殤g (I: Th蘯･p/Trung bﾃｬnh/Cao) cho t盻ｫng r盻ｧi ro.\\n- [ ] Tﾃｭnh ﾄ訴盻ノ x蘯ｿp h蘯｡ng ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn c盻ｧa t盻ｫng r盻ｧi ro vﾃ xﾃ｡c ﾄ黛ｻ杵h d蘯･u hi盻㎡ nh蘯ｭn bi蘯ｿt (Early Warning Triggers).\\n- [ ] Ch盻・ﾄ黛ｻ杵h c盻･ th盻・ngﾆｰ盻拱 ch盻丘 trﾃ｡ch nhi盻㍊ ki盻ノ soﾃ｡t (Risk Owner) cho t盻ｫng m盻･c.\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- Tﾃi li盻㎡ `docs/planning/risk-register.md` g盻杜 b蘯｣ng danh m盻･c 10 r盻ｧi ro chu蘯ｩn PMBOK.\\n- Dﾃ｡n b蘯｣ng tﾃｳm t蘯ｯt r盻ｧi ro vﾃo comment issue nﾃy.\\n\\n**Deadline:** 27/09/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm3Xg\",\"name\":\"type: docs\",\"description\":\"Tﾃi li盻㎡ d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n\",\"color\":\"e4e669\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm4ug\",\"name\":\"owner: hoang\",\"description\":\"Hoﾃng (PM / Scrum Master)\",\"color\":\"1d76db\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":20,\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"[PM] PM-14: L蘯ｭp B蘯｣ng ﾄ惰ハg kﾃｽ r盻ｧi ro (Risk Register) v盻嬖 thang ﾄ訴盻ノ Pﾃ悠\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDOEP5Lkg\",\"login\":\"plhhoang2005\",\"name\":\"Hoang Pham\",\"databaseId\":285100946}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nT盻・ch盻ｩc h盻膏 t盻貧g k蘯ｿt Tu蘯ｧn 2: ﾄ静｡nh giﾃ｡ ti蘯ｿn ﾄ黛ｻ・phﾃ｢n tﾃｭch thi蘯ｿt k蘯ｿ vﾃ kﾃｽ duy盻㏄ h盻・sﾆ｡ WBS.\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] Ki盻ノ tra k蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ hoﾃn thﾃnh tﾃi li盻㎡ SRS c盻ｧa BA, Prototype c盻ｧa UI/UX vﾃ ERD c盻ｧa QA.\\n- [ ] ﾄ静｡nh giﾃ｡ cﾃ｡c task hoﾃn thﾃnh ﾄ妥ｺng h蘯｡n vﾃ ghi nh蘯ｭn cﾃ｡c task b盻・tr盻・h蘯｡n c蘯ｧn bﾃｹ ti蘯ｿn ﾄ黛ｻ・\\n- [ ] L蘯ｭp Biﾃｪn b蘯｣n cu盻冂 h盻膏 s盻・02 ghi nh蘯ｭn cﾃ｡c ﾄ訴盻「 ch盻穎h v盻・m蘯ｷt phﾃ｢n cﾃｴng.\\n- [ ] Lﾃｪn k蘯ｿ ho蘯｡ch ch蘯｡y nﾆｰ盻嫩 rﾃｺt cho Tu蘯ｧn 3 (Sprint 2: Xﾃ｢y d盻ｱng khung mﾃ｣ ngu盻渡).\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- Biﾃｪn b蘯｣n cu盻冂 h盻膏 lﾆｰu t蘯｡i `docs/meetings/meeting-02-week2.md`.\\n- C蘯ｭp nh蘯ｭt tr蘯｡ng thﾃ｡i cﾃ｡c issue trﾃｪn GitHub Project Board.\\n\\n**Deadline:** 20/09/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm3Xg\",\"name\":\"type: docs\",\"description\":\"Tﾃi li盻㎡ d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n\",\"color\":\"e4e669\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm4ug\",\"name\":\"owner: hoang\",\"description\":\"Hoﾃng (PM / Scrum Master)\",\"color\":\"1d76db\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm7VA\",\"name\":\"priority: medium\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn trung bﾃｬnh\",\"color\":\"fbca04\"}],\"number\":19,\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"[PM] PM-13: Biﾃｪn b蘯｣n h盻膏 tu蘯ｧn 2: ﾄ静｡nh giﾃ｡ phﾃ｢n rﾃ｣ cﾃｴng vi盻㌘ vﾃ ch盻奏 WBS\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDOEP5Lkg\",\"login\":\"plhhoang2005\",\"name\":\"Hoang Pham\",\"databaseId\":285100946}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nﾆｯ盻嫩 tﾃｭnh n盻・l盻ｱc vﾃ ngﾃ｢n sﾃ｡ch d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n theo mﾃｴ hﾃｬnh COCOMO cﾆ｡ b蘯｣n (Constructive Cost Model) chu蘯ｩn PMBOK.\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [x] ﾆｯ盻嫩 lﾆｰ盻｣ng quy mﾃｴ dﾃｲng l盻㌻h cho d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n ti盻㌘ cﾆｰ盻嬖: 6.9 KLOC (ch蘯ｿ ﾄ黛ｻ・Organic: a=2.4, b=1.05, c=2.5, d=0.38).\\n- [x] Tﾃｭnh toﾃ｡n t盻貧g n盻・l盻ｱc: $E = a \\times (KLOC)^b$ (ngﾆｰ盻拱-thﾃ｡ng).\\n- [x] Tﾃｭnh toﾃ｡n th盻拱 gian phﾃ｡t tri盻ハ d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n: $TDEV = c \\times E^d$ (thﾃ｡ng).\\n- [x] Tﾃｭnh s盻・lﾆｰ盻｣ng nhﾃ｢n s盻ｱ lﾃｽ thuy蘯ｿt c蘯ｧn thi蘯ｿt: $SS = E / TDEV$ vﾃ nﾄハg su蘯･t lao ﾄ黛ｻ冢g.\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- Tﾃi li盻㎡ tﾃｭnh toﾃ｡n chi phﾃｭ `docs/planning/cocomo-estimation.md`.\\n- B蘯｣ng d盻ｱ toﾃ｡n ngﾃ｢n sﾃ｡ch t盻貧g th盻・ﾄ妥ｭnh kﾃｨm vﾃo bﾃ｡o cﾃ｡o gi盻ｯa k盻ｳ.\\n\\n**Deadline:** 20/09/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm3Xg\",\"name\":\"type: docs\",\"description\":\"Tﾃi li盻㎡ d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n\",\"color\":\"e4e669\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm4ug\",\"name\":\"owner: hoang\",\"description\":\"Hoﾃng (PM / Scrum Master)\",\"color\":\"1d76db\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":18,\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"[PM] PM-12: ﾆｯ盻嫩 tﾃｭnh chi phﾃｭ theo mﾃｴ hﾃｬnh COCOMO cﾆ｡ b蘯｣n\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDOEP5Lkg\",\"login\":\"plhhoang2005\",\"name\":\"Hoang Pham\",\"databaseId\":285100946}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nL蘯ｭp bi盻ブ ﾄ黛ｻ・Gantt t盻貧g th盻・trﾃｪn MS Project, phﾃ｢n b盻・tﾃi nguyﾃｪn vﾃ ch盻奏 ﾄ脆ｰ盻拵g cﾆ｡ s盻・d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n (Baseline Plan).\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] Nh蘯ｭp toﾃn b盻・WBS, th盻拱 lﾆｰ盻｣ng vﾃ m盻訴 quan h盻・Predecessor vﾃo ph蘯ｧn m盻［ Microsoft Project.\\n- [ ] Gﾃ｡n tﾃi nguyﾃｪn (Resource Name: Hoﾃng, Hi盻ハ, Nhﾃ｢n, Phﾃｺc, H蘯ｭu) cho t盻ｫng cﾃｴng vi盻㌘.\\n- [ ] Ki盻ノ tra xung ﾄ黛ｻ冲 phﾃ｢n b盻・quﾃ｡ t蘯｣i (Overallocated resources) vﾃ ﾄ訴盻「 ch盻穎h cﾃ｢n b蘯ｱng t蘯｣i.\\n- [ ] Lﾆｰu Baseline (Set Baseline) ﾄ黛ｻ・lﾃm m盻祖 so sﾃ｡nh ti蘯ｿn ﾄ黛ｻ・th盻ｱc t蘯ｿ sau nﾃy.\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- File Microsoft Project `docs/planning/EVManager_Gantt_Baseline.mpp`.\\n- Xu蘯･t 蘯｣nh ch盻･p Gantt Chart lﾆｰu t蘯｡i `docs/planning/gantt-baseline.png`.\\n\\n**Deadline:** 20/09/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm3Xg\",\"name\":\"type: docs\",\"description\":\"Tﾃi li盻㎡ d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n\",\"color\":\"e4e669\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm4ug\",\"name\":\"owner: hoang\",\"description\":\"Hoﾃng (PM / Scrum Master)\",\"color\":\"1d76db\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":17,\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"[PM] PM-11: L蘯ｭp ti蘯ｿn ﾄ黛ｻ・t盻貧g th盻・trﾃｪn Gantt Chart vﾃ ch盻奏 ﾄ柁ｰ盻拵g cﾆ｡ s盻・(Baseline)\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDOEP5Lkg\",\"login\":\"plhhoang2005\",\"name\":\"Hoang Pham\",\"databaseId\":285100946}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nXﾃ｡c ﾄ黛ｻ杵h ﾄ脆ｰ盻拵g gﾄハg (Critical Path Method - CPM) vﾃ t盻訴 ﾆｰu hﾃｳa ti蘯ｿn ﾄ黛ｻ・ﾄ黛ｻ・ﾄ黛ｺ｣m b蘯｣o d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n khﾃｴng b盻・vﾆｰ盻｣t quﾃ｡ gi盻嬖 h蘯｡n 8 tu蘯ｧn.\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] Th盻ｱc hi盻㌻ thu蘯ｭt toﾃ｡n Forward Pass tﾃｭnh th盻拱 ﾄ訴盻ノ s盻嬶 nh蘯･t (ES, EF).\\n- [ ] Th盻ｱc hi盻㌻ thu蘯ｭt toﾃ｡n Backward Pass tﾃｭnh th盻拱 ﾄ訴盻ノ mu盻冢 nh蘯･t (LS, LF).\\n- [ ] Tﾃｭnh th盻拱 gian d盻ｱ tr盻ｯ t盻ｱ do (Total Float = LS - ES = 0) ﾄ黛ｻ・tﾃｬm ra cﾃ｡c cﾃｴng vi盻㌘ gﾄハg.\\n- [ ] Ch盻・ra ﾄ柁ｰ盻拵g gﾄハg dﾃi nh蘯･t vﾃ ﾄ黛ｻ・xu蘯･t gi蘯｣i phﾃ｡p t盻訴 ﾆｰu rﾃｺt ng蘯ｯn ﾄ柁ｰ盻拵g gﾄハg (Crash/Fast-track).\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- Tﾃi li盻㎡ phﾃ｢n tﾃｭch ﾄ柁ｰ盻拵g gﾄハg trong `docs/planning/critical-path-analysis.md`.\\n- Bﾃ｡o cﾃ｡o gi蘯｣i trﾃｬnh rﾃｺt ng蘯ｯn ti蘯ｿn ﾄ黛ｻ・trong cu盻冂 h盻膏 tu蘯ｧn 2.\\n\\n**Deadline:** 20/09/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm3Xg\",\"name\":\"type: docs\",\"description\":\"Tﾃi li盻㎡ d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n\",\"color\":\"e4e669\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm4ug\",\"name\":\"owner: hoang\",\"description\":\"Hoﾃng (PM / Scrum Master)\",\"color\":\"1d76db\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":16,\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"[PM] PM-10: Xﾃ｡c ﾄ黛ｻ杵h ﾄ柁ｰ盻拵g gﾄハg (Critical Path Method - CPM) vﾃ th盻拱 gian d盻ｱ tr盻ｯ\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDOEP5Lkg\",\"login\":\"plhhoang2005\",\"name\":\"Hoang Pham\",\"databaseId\":285100946}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nXﾃ｢y d盻ｱng Sﾆ｡ ﾄ黛ｻ・m蘯｡ng cﾃｴng vi盻㌘ (PERT Network Diagram) ﾄ黛ｻ・tr盻ｱc quan hﾃｳa m盻訴 quan h盻・ph盻･ thu盻冂 trﾆｰ盻嫩 sau gi盻ｯa cﾃ｡c nhﾃ｡nh cﾃｴng vi盻㌘ trong d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n.\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] Li盻㏄ kﾃｪ danh sﾃ｡ch cﾃ｡c cﾃｴng vi盻㌘ nﾃｺt m蘯｡ng vﾃ th盻ｩ t盻ｱ th盻ｱc hi盻㌻ (A, B, C, D, E, F, G, H, I).\\n- [ ] V蘯ｽ cﾃ｡c nﾃｺt cﾃｴng vi盻㌘ g盻杜 6 thﾃｴng s盻・ Early Start (ES), Duration, Early Finish (EF), Late Start (LS), Float, Late Finish (LF).\\n- [ ] Xﾃ｡c ﾄ黛ｻ杵h cﾃ｡c cﾃｴng vi盻㌘ cﾃｳ th盻・lﾃm song song (VD: Vi蘯ｿt test case song song v盻嬖 Phﾃ｡t tri盻ハ ph蘯ｧn m盻［).\\n- [ ] V蘯ｽ sﾆ｡ ﾄ黛ｻ・m蘯｡ng b蘯ｱng Microsoft PowerPoint ho蘯ｷc Draw.io nhﾆｰ bﾃi m蘯ｫu Baocao.pdf.\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- File 蘯｣nh sﾆ｡ ﾄ黛ｻ・m蘯｡ng `docs/planning/pert-diagram.png` vﾃ slide thuy蘯ｿt trﾃｬnh.\\n- ﾄ静ｭnh kﾃｨm hﾃｬnh 蘯｣nh PERT vﾃo comment issue nﾃy.\\n\\n**Deadline:** 20/09/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm3Xg\",\"name\":\"type: docs\",\"description\":\"Tﾃi li盻㎡ d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n\",\"color\":\"e4e669\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm4ug\",\"name\":\"owner: hoang\",\"description\":\"Hoﾃng (PM / Scrum Master)\",\"color\":\"1d76db\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":15,\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"[PM] PM-09: Xﾃ｢y d盻ｱng sﾆ｡ ﾄ黛ｻ・m蘯｡ng cﾃｴng vi盻㌘ (PERT Network Diagram)\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDOEP5Lkg\",\"login\":\"plhhoang2005\",\"name\":\"Hoang Pham\",\"databaseId\":285100946}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nBiﾃｪn so蘯｡n T盻ｫ ﾄ訴盻ハ phﾃ｢n rﾃ｣ cﾃｴng vi盻㌘ (WBS Dictionary) nh蘯ｱm ﾄ黛ｻ杵h nghﾄｩa rﾃｵ rﾃng n盻冓 dung, ﾄ黛ｺｧu vﾃo, tiﾃｪu chﾃｭ ch蘯･p nh蘯ｭn cho t盻ｫng gﾃｳi cﾃｴng vi盻㌘ c蘯･p 4.\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] T蘯｡o b蘯｣ng mﾃｴ t蘯｣ chi ti蘯ｿt cho t盻ｫng mﾃ｣ WBS ﾄ妥｣ phﾃ｢n rﾃ｣.\\n- [ ] Xﾃ｡c ﾄ黛ｻ杵h k蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ bﾃn giao c盻･ th盻・(Deliverables) cho t盻ｫng task.\\n- [ ] Xﾃ｡c ﾄ黛ｻ杵h tﾃi nguyﾃｪn nhﾃ｢n l盻ｱc vﾃ th盻拱 gian ﾆｰ盻嫩 tﾃｭnh (ngﾃy cﾃｴng) cho t盻ｫng ngﾆｰ盻拱.\\n- [ ] Ghi nh蘯ｭn cﾃ｡c ph盻･ thu盻冂 ti盻］ ﾄ黛ｻ・(Predecessors) c盻ｧa t盻ｫng cﾃｴng vi盻㌘.\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- Tﾃi li盻㎡ `docs/planning/wbs-dictionary.md`.\\n- ﾄ雪ｻ訴 chi蘯ｿu WBS Dictionary v盻嬖 Product Backlog c盻ｧa BA.\\n\\n**Deadline:** 20/09/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm3Xg\",\"name\":\"type: docs\",\"description\":\"Tﾃi li盻㎡ d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n\",\"color\":\"e4e669\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm4ug\",\"name\":\"owner: hoang\",\"description\":\"Hoﾃng (PM / Scrum Master)\",\"color\":\"1d76db\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":14,\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"[PM] PM-08: L蘯ｭp T盻ｫ ﾄ訴盻ハ cﾃｴng vi盻㌘ (WBS Dictionary) mﾃｴ t蘯｣ chi ti蘯ｿt t盻ｫng gﾃｳi cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDOEP5Lkg\",\"login\":\"plhhoang2005\",\"name\":\"Hoang Pham\",\"databaseId\":285100946}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nXﾃ｢y d盻ｱng C蘯･u trﾃｺc phﾃ｢n rﾃ｣ cﾃｴng vi盻㌘ (Work Breakdown Structure - WBS) ﾄ黛ｺｿn c蘯･p 4 ﾄ黛ｻ・chia nh盻・d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n thﾃnh cﾃ｡c gﾃｳi cﾃｴng vi盻㌘ (Work Packages) c盻･ th盻・\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] Phﾃ｢n rﾃ｣ c蘯･p 1: D盻ｱ ﾃ｡n EVManager.\\n- [ ] Phﾃ｢n rﾃ｣ c蘯･p 2 thﾃnh 5 giai ﾄ双蘯｡n: Kh盻殃 t蘯｡o, Phﾃ｢n tﾃｭch \u0026 Thi蘯ｿt k蘯ｿ, Xﾃ｢y d盻ｱng ph蘯ｧn m盻［, Ki盻ノ th盻ｭ \u0026 Tri盻ハ khai, ﾄ静ｳng d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n.\\n- [ ] Phﾃ｢n rﾃ｣ c蘯･p 3 vﾃ c蘯･p 4 cho t盻ｫng phﾃ｢n h盻・k盻ｹ thu蘯ｭt (Auth, Venues, Customers, Bookings, Contracts, Payments, Reports).\\n- [ ] Gﾃ｡n mﾃ｣ s盻・WBS duy nh蘯･t (VD: 1.1, 1.2.1, 2.1.1.1) vﾃ ngﾆｰ盻拱 ph盻･ trﾃ｡ch cho t盻ｫng gﾃｳi cﾃｴng vi盻㌘.\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- B蘯｣ng tﾃｭnh Excel `docs/planning/WBS_EVManager_Detailed.xlsx` vﾃ file CSV `WBS_EVManager.csv`.\\n- Dﾃ｡n sﾆ｡ ﾄ黛ｻ・cﾃ｢y WBS vﾃo tﾃi li盻㎡ t盻貧g th盻・c盻ｧa nhﾃｳm.\\n\\n**Deadline:** 20/09/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm3Xg\",\"name\":\"type: docs\",\"description\":\"Tﾃi li盻㎡ d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n\",\"color\":\"e4e669\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm4ug\",\"name\":\"owner: hoang\",\"description\":\"Hoﾃng (PM / Scrum Master)\",\"color\":\"1d76db\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":13,\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"[PM] PM-07: Xﾃ｢y d盻ｱng C蘯･u trﾃｺc phﾃ｢n rﾃ｣ cﾃｴng vi盻㌘ WBS ﾄ黛ｺｿn c蘯･p 4\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDOEP5Lkg\",\"login\":\"plhhoang2005\",\"name\":\"Hoang Pham\",\"databaseId\":285100946}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nXﾃ｢y d盻ｱng K蘯ｿ ho蘯｡ch qu蘯｣n lﾃｽ truy盻］ thﾃｴng (Communication Management Plan) nh蘯ｱm ﾄ黛ｺ｣m b蘯｣o thﾃｴng tin d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n ﾄ柁ｰ盻｣c truy盻］ ﾄ黛ｺ｡t chﾃｭnh xﾃ｡c, k盻却 th盻拱 vﾃ b蘯｣o m蘯ｭt.\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] Xﾃ｡c ﾄ黛ｻ杵h cﾃ｡c kﾃｪnh truy盻］ thﾃｴng chﾃｭnh th盻ｩc: GitHub (qu蘯｣n lﾃｽ mﾃ｣ ngu盻渡/task), Zalo (thﾃｴng bﾃ｡o kh蘯ｩn), Google Meet (h盻膏 tu蘯ｧn).\\n- [ ] L蘯ｭp ma tr蘯ｭn phﾃ｢n ph盻訴 thﾃｴng tin: Ai nh蘯ｭn bﾃ｡o cﾃ｡o gﾃｬ, t蘯ｧn su蘯･t vﾃ ﾄ黛ｻ杵h d蘯｡ng tﾃi li盻㎡.\\n- [ ] Quy ﾄ黛ｻ杵h quy盻］ truy c蘯ｭp thﾆｰ m盻･c tﾃi li盻㎡ d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n trﾃｪn mﾃ｡y ch盻ｧ/GitHub (Read/Write/Admin).\\n- [ ] Quy ﾄ黛ｻ杵h quy trﾃｬnh gi蘯｣i quy蘯ｿt xung ﾄ黛ｻ冲 ﾃｽ ki蘯ｿn k盻ｹ thu蘯ｭt theo nguyﾃｪn t蘯ｯc t蘯ｭp trung dﾃ｢n ch盻ｧ.\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- Tﾃi li盻㎡ `docs/planning/communication-plan.md`.\\n- PM ki盻ノ tra vﾃ ﾄ柁ｰa vﾃo ﾃ｡p d盻･ng ngay t盻ｫ Tu蘯ｧn 2.\\n\\n**Deadline:** 13/09/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm3Xg\",\"name\":\"type: docs\",\"description\":\"Tﾃi li盻㎡ d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n\",\"color\":\"e4e669\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm4ug\",\"name\":\"owner: hoang\",\"description\":\"Hoﾃng (PM / Scrum Master)\",\"color\":\"1d76db\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm7VA\",\"name\":\"priority: medium\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn trung bﾃｬnh\",\"color\":\"fbca04\"}],\"number\":12,\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"[PM] PM-06: L蘯ｭp K蘯ｿ ho蘯｡ch qu蘯｣n lﾃｽ truy盻］ thﾃｴng vﾃ phﾃ｢n quy盻］ truy c蘯ｭp tﾃi li盻㎡\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDOEP5Lkg\",\"login\":\"plhhoang2005\",\"name\":\"Hoang Pham\",\"databaseId\":285100946}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nT盻・ch盻ｩc phiﾃｪn h盻膏 kh盻殃 ﾄ黛ｻ冢g (Kick-off Meeting) ﾄ黛ｻ・t蘯｡o s盻ｱ ﾄ黛ｻ渡g thu蘯ｭn v盻・phﾆｰﾆ｡ng phﾃ｡p phﾃ｡t tri盻ハ Agile/Scrum k蘯ｿt h盻｣p PMBOK.\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] Lﾃｪn chﾆｰﾆ｡ng trﾃｬnh h盻膏: Gi盻嬖 thi盻㎡ ﾄ黛ｻ・tﾃi, phﾃ｢n chia vai trﾃｲ, quy ﾄ黛ｻ杵h gi盻・lﾃm vi盻㌘ vﾃ kﾃｪnh liﾃｪn l蘯｡c.\\n- [ ] Th盻創g nh蘯･t s盻ｭ d盻･ng GitHub Projects \u0026 Issues ﾄ黛ｻ・qu蘯｣n lﾃｽ toﾃn b盻・task thay cho Jira.\\n- [ ] L蘯ｭp Biﾃｪn b蘯｣n cu盻冂 h盻膏 s盻・01 ghi nh蘯ｭn ﾄ黛ｺｧy ﾄ黛ｻｧ ch盻ｯ kﾃｽ ho蘯ｷc xﾃ｡c nh蘯ｭn c盻ｧa 5 thﾃnh viﾃｪn.\\n- [ ] Thi蘯ｿt l蘯ｭp l盻議h h盻膏 ﾄ黛ｻ杵h k盻ｳ hﾃng tu蘯ｧn (Weekly Scrum) vﾃo t盻訴 Ch盻ｧ Nh蘯ｭt.\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- Biﾃｪn b蘯｣n cu盻冂 h盻膏 lﾆｰu t蘯｡i `docs/meetings/meeting-01-kickoff.md`.\\n- ﾄ斉ハg biﾃｪn b蘯｣n lﾃｪn nhﾃｳm trao ﾄ黛ｻ品 chung.\\n\\n**Deadline:** 13/09/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm3Xg\",\"name\":\"type: docs\",\"description\":\"Tﾃi li盻㎡ d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n\",\"color\":\"e4e669\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm4ug\",\"name\":\"owner: hoang\",\"description\":\"Hoﾃng (PM / Scrum Master)\",\"color\":\"1d76db\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":11,\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"[PM] PM-05: T盻・ch盻ｩc h盻膏 Kick-off d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n vﾃ l蘯ｭp Biﾃｪn b蘯｣n h盻膏 s盻・01\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDOEP5Lkg\",\"login\":\"plhhoang2005\",\"name\":\"Hoang Pham\",\"databaseId\":285100946}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nThi蘯ｿt l蘯ｭp mﾃｴi trﾆｰ盻拵g lﾃm vi盻㌘ chu蘯ｩn trﾃｪn GitHub, phﾃ｢n chia nhﾃ｡nh vﾃ c蘯･u hﾃｬnh quy t蘯ｯc b蘯｣o v盻・mﾃ｣ ngu盻渡 (Branch Protection) cho c蘯｣ nhﾃｳm.\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] Kh盻殃 t蘯｡o repository chﾃｭnh th盻ｩc `plhhoang2005/EVManager` vﾃ m盻拱 4 thﾃnh viﾃｪn vﾃo lﾃm Collaborator.\\n- [ ] T蘯｡o 2 nhﾃ｡nh c盻・ﾄ黛ｻ杵h: `main` (production/release) vﾃ `develop` (nhﾃ｡nh tﾃｭch h盻｣p chung).\\n- [ ] C蘯･u hﾃｬnh `develop` lﾃm nhﾃ｡nh m蘯ｷc ﾄ黛ｻ杵h (Default Branch).\\n- [ ] So蘯｡n th蘯｣o t盻㎝ quy ﾆｰ盻嫩 lﾃm vi盻㌘ `AGENTS.md` vﾃ tﾃi li盻㎡ hﾆｰ盻嬾g d蘯ｫn branch `docs/planning/github-week1-setup.md`.\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- Repository GitHub ho蘯｡t ﾄ黛ｻ冢g v盻嬖 ﾄ黛ｺｧy ﾄ黛ｻｧ branch, `.gitignore` vﾃ `README.md`.\\n- PM nghi盻㍊ thu c蘯･u hﾃｬnh Git vﾃ thﾃｴng bﾃ｡o cho nhﾃｳm.\\n\\n**Deadline:** 13/09/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm4Iw\",\"name\":\"type: chore\",\"description\":\"Setup, c蘯･u hﾃｬnh, tooling\",\"color\":\"e4e4e4\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm4ug\",\"name\":\"owner: hoang\",\"description\":\"Hoﾃng (PM / Scrum Master)\",\"color\":\"1d76db\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":10,\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"[PM] PM-04: Thi蘯ｿt l蘯ｭp c蘯･u trﾃｺc Repository GitHub, b蘯｣o v盻・nhﾃ｡nh vﾃ quy chu蘯ｩn Commit\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDOEP5Lkg\",\"login\":\"plhhoang2005\",\"name\":\"Hoang Pham\",\"databaseId\":285100946}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nXﾃ｡c l蘯ｭp Phﾃ｡t bi盻ブ ph蘯｡m vi (Scope Statement) nh蘯ｱm ﾄ妥ｳng khung cﾃ｡c tﾃｭnh nﾄハg b蘯ｯt bu盻冂 lﾃm (In-scope) vﾃ lo蘯｡i tr盻ｫ cﾃ｡c tﾃｭnh nﾄハg vﾆｰ盻｣t ngoﾃi kh蘯｣ nﾄハg trong 8 tu蘯ｧn (Out-of-scope).\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] ﾄ雪ｻ訴 chi蘯ｿu tiﾃｪu chﾃｭ ﾄ黛ｻ・ﾃ｡n m盻ｩc Khﾃ｡ c盻ｧa ﾄ黛ｻ・tﾃi LV34-001 (4-5 actors, 10-14 use cases, 3 quy trﾃｬnh lﾃｵi).\\n- [ ] Li盻㏄ kﾃｪ chi ti蘯ｿt danh m盻･c In-scope: Qu蘯｣n lﾃｽ s蘯｣nh, Khﾃ｡ch hﾃng, Th盻ｱc ﾄ柁｡n, ﾄ雪ｺｷt ti盻㌘, Ki盻ノ tra trﾃｹng l盻議h, H盻｣p ﾄ黛ｻ渡g, C盻皇, Dashboard.\\n- [ ] Li盻㏄ kﾃｪ danh m盻･c Out-of-scope: 盻ｨng d盻･ng di ﾄ黛ｻ冢g (Mobile App), C盻貧g thanh toﾃ｡n tr盻ｱc tuy蘯ｿn th盻ｱc t蘯ｿ (ch盻・mﾃｴ ph盻熟g).\\n- [ ] Xﾃ｡c ﾄ黛ｻ杵h rﾃｵ cﾃ｡c gi蘯｣ ﾄ黛ｻ杵h (Assumptions) vﾃ rﾃng bu盻冂 k盻ｹ thu蘯ｭt (Constraints).\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- Tﾃi li盻㎡ `docs/charter/scope_statement.md` vﾃ file Word `Scope_Statement_EVManager.docx`.\\n- PM nghi盻㍊ thu vﾃ lﾆｰu tr盻ｯ vﾃo h盻・sﾆ｡ qu蘯｣n tr盻・\\n\\n**Deadline:** 13/09/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm3Xg\",\"name\":\"type: docs\",\"description\":\"Tﾃi li盻㎡ d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n\",\"color\":\"e4e669\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm4ug\",\"name\":\"owner: hoang\",\"description\":\"Hoﾃng (PM / Scrum Master)\",\"color\":\"1d76db\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":9,\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"[PM] PM-03: Xﾃ｡c l蘯ｭp ph蘯｡m vi phﾃ｡t bi盻ブ (Scope Statement: In-scope \u0026 Out-of-scope)\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDOEP5Lkg\",\"login\":\"plhhoang2005\",\"name\":\"Hoang Pham\",\"databaseId\":285100946}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nXﾃ｢y d盻ｱng ma tr蘯ｭn phﾃ｢n cﾃｴng trﾃ｡ch nhi盻㍊ RACI (Responsible, Accountable, Consulted, Informed) ﾄ黛ｻ・lﾃm rﾃｵ vai trﾃｲ, trﾃ｡nh ch盻渡g chﾃｩo cﾃｴng vi盻㌘ gi盻ｯa 5 thﾃnh viﾃｪn.\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] Li盻㏄ kﾃｪ danh sﾃ｡ch 5 thﾃnh viﾃｪn: Hoﾃng (PM), Hi盻ハ (BA), Nhﾃ｢n (UI/UX), Phﾃｺc (Backend), H蘯ｭu (QA).\\n- [ ] Phﾃ｢n lo蘯｡i trﾃ｡ch nhi盻㍊ cho t盻ｫng nhﾃｳm cﾃｴng vi盻㌘: Qu蘯｣n lﾃｽ d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n, Phﾃ｢n tﾃｭch nghi盻㎝ v盻･, Thi蘯ｿt k蘯ｿ giao di盻㌻, L蘯ｭp trﾃｬnh API, ﾄ雪ｺ｣m b蘯｣o ch蘯･t lﾆｰ盻｣ng.\\n- [ ] ﾄ雪ｺ｣m b蘯｣o m盻擁 cﾃｴng vi盻㌘ ch盻・cﾃｳ duy nh蘯･t 1 ngﾆｰ盻拱 ch盻丘 trﾃ｡ch nhi盻㍊ chﾃｭnh (A - Accountable).\\n- [ ] Th盻創g nh蘯･t ma tr蘯ｭn RACI trong cu盻冂 h盻膏 n盻冓 b盻・nhﾃｳm.\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- T蘯｡o tﾃi li盻㎡ `docs/planning/raci.md`.\\n- Dﾃ｡n b蘯｣ng RACI vﾃo comment issue nﾃy ﾄ黛ｻ・toﾃn ﾄ黛ｻ冓 ngﾅｩ xﾃ｡c nh蘯ｭn.\\n\\n**Deadline:** 13/09/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm3Xg\",\"name\":\"type: docs\",\"description\":\"Tﾃi li盻㎡ d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n\",\"color\":\"e4e669\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm4ug\",\"name\":\"owner: hoang\",\"description\":\"Hoﾃng (PM / Scrum Master)\",\"color\":\"1d76db\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":8,\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"[PM] PM-02: L蘯ｭp ma tr蘯ｭn phﾃ｢n cﾃｴng trﾃ｡ch nhi盻㍊ RACI chi ti蘯ｿt cho 5 thﾃnh viﾃｪn\"},{\"assignees\":[{\"id\":\"U_kgDOEP5Lkg\",\"login\":\"plhhoang2005\",\"name\":\"Hoang Pham\",\"databaseId\":285100946}],\"body\":\"### 識 M盻･c tiﾃｪu\\nSo蘯｡n th蘯｣o b蘯｣n Tﾃｴn ch盻・d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n (Project Charter) chﾃｭnh th盻ｩc ﾄ黛ｻ・ﾄ黛ｻ杵h hﾃｬnh m盻･c tiﾃｪu SMART, ranh gi盻嬖 ph蘯｡m vi vﾃ c蘯･p quy盻］ cho Ban Qu蘯｣n lﾃｽ d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n theo chu蘯ｩn PMBOK.\\n\\n### 搭 Checklist cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] Kh蘯｣o sﾃ｡t b盻訴 c蘯｣nh bﾃi toﾃ｡n qu蘯｣n lﾃｽ ti盻㌘ cﾆｰ盻嬖 vﾃ nﾃｪu rﾃｵ Problem Statement.\\n- [ ] Thi蘯ｿt l蘯ｭp 6 m盻･c tiﾃｪu SMART (Specific, Measurable, Achievable, Relevant, Time-bound).\\n- [ ] Xﾃ｡c ﾄ黛ｻ杵h cﾃ｡c bﾃｪn liﾃｪn quan (Stakeholders), Nhﾃ tﾃi tr盻｣ (Sponsor) vﾃ vai trﾃｲ c盻ｧa PM.\\n- [ ] L蘯ｭp b蘯｣ng tﾃｳm t蘯ｯt ngﾃ｢n sﾃ｡ch d盻ｱ ki蘯ｿn vﾃ cﾃ｡c c盻冲 m盻祖 th盻拱 gian chﾃｭnh (Milestones 8 tu蘯ｧn).\\n\\n### 逃 K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao n盻冪 (Deliverables)\\n- Tﾃi li盻㎡ `docs/charter/project_charter.md` vﾃ file Word `Project_Charter_EVManager.docx`.\\n- G盻ｭi tﾃi li盻㎡ cho Gi蘯｣ng viﾃｪn hﾆｰ盻嬾g d蘯ｫn duy盻㏄ ph蘯｡m vi.\\n\\n**Deadline:** 13/09/2026\\n\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm3Xg\",\"name\":\"type: docs\",\"description\":\"Tﾃi li盻㎡ d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n\",\"color\":\"e4e669\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm4ug\",\"name\":\"owner: hoang\",\"description\":\"Hoﾃng (PM / Scrum Master)\",\"color\":\"1d76db\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"}],\"number\":7,\"state\":\"CLOSED\",\"title\":\"[PM] PM-01: So蘯｡n th蘯｣o Tﾃｴn ch盻・d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n (Project Charter) \u0026 M盻･c tiﾃｪu SMART\"},{\"assignees\":[],\"body\":\"### Mﾃｴ t蘯｣ cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n- [ ] Xﾃ｡c ﾄ黛ｻ杵h 8窶・0 th盻ｱc th盻・d盻ｯ li盻㎡ (Users, Customers, Services, Events, Contracts, Payments...)\\n- [ ] L蘯ｭp k蘯ｿ ho蘯｡ch ki盻ノ th盻ｭ (Test Plan) vﾃ khung 35 test cases t盻訴 thi盻ブ\\n- [ ] Chu蘯ｩn b盻・k盻議h b蘯｣n ki盻ノ tra xung ﾄ黛ｻ冲 trﾃｹng l盻議h s盻ｱ ki盻㌻\\n\\n**Ngﾆｰ盻拱 ph盻･ trﾃ｡ch:** H蘯ｭu (DB/QA)\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm3Xg\",\"name\":\"type: docs\",\"description\":\"Tﾃi li盻㎡ d盻ｱ ﾃ｡n\",\"color\":\"e4e669\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6kw\",\"name\":\"owner: hau\",\"description\":\"H蘯ｭu (Database \u0026 QA/Tester)\",\"color\":\"c5def5\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6-Q\",\"name\":\"priority: high\",\"description\":\"ﾄ雪ｻ・ﾆｰu tiﾃｪn cao\",\"color\":\"b60205\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm8gQ\",\"name\":\"status: in-progress\",\"description\":\"ﾄ紳ng th盻ｱc hi盻㌻\",\"color\":\"ffa500\"}],\"number\":6,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[DB/QA] Xﾃ｡c ﾄ黛ｻ杵h Data Requirements \u0026 Danh m盻･c ki盻ノ th盻ｭ ban ﾄ黛ｺｧu\"},{\"assignees\":[],\"body\":\"# [Backend] Kh盻殃 t蘯｡o ki蘯ｿn trﾃｺc Spring Boot \u0026 JPA Backend Skeleton\\n\\n## Mﾃｴ t蘯｣ cﾃｴng vi盻㌘\\n\\nKh盻殃 t蘯｡o mﾃ｣ ngu盻渡 Backend vﾃ ki蘯ｿn trﾃｺc d盻議h v盻･ n盻］ t蘯｣ng cho h盻・th盻創g EVManager theo Tech Stack chﾃｭnh th盻ｩc c盻ｧa nhﾃｳm.\\n\\n## Tech Stack\\n\\n- Java 21 LTS\\n- Spring Boot\\n- Spring Web\\n- Spring Data JPA + Hibernate\\n- PostgreSQL\\n- Flyway\\n- Jakarta Bean Validation\\n- Spring Security + JWT\\n- Springdoc OpenAPI/Swagger\\n- Maven\\n- JUnit 5 + Mockito + Spring Boot Test\\n- SLF4J + Logback\\n\\n## Checklist\\n\\n- [x] Kh盻殃 t蘯｡o project Spring Boot s盻ｭ d盻･ng Java 21 LTS vﾃ Maven.\\n- [x] ﾄ雪ｺｷt mﾃ｣ ngu盻渡 Backend trong thﾆｰ m盻･c `backend/`.\\n- [x] C蘯･u hﾃｬnh Spring Web ﾄ黛ｻ・xﾃ｢y d盻ｱng REST API.\\n- [x] C蘯･u hﾃｬnh k蘯ｿt n盻訴 PostgreSQL.\\n- [x] C蘯･u hﾃｬnh Spring Data JPA + Hibernate.\\n- [x] C蘯･u hﾃｬnh Flyway ﾄ黛ｻ・qu蘯｣n lﾃｽ Database Migration.\\n- [x] C蘯･u hﾃｬnh Jakarta Bean Validation.\\n- [x] C蘯･u hﾃｬnh Spring Security + JWT.\\n- [x] C蘯･u hﾃｬnh Springdoc OpenAPI/Swagger.\\n- [x] Thi蘯ｿt l蘯ｭp logging v盻嬖 SLF4J + Logback.\\n- [x] T蘯｡o c蘯･u trﾃｺc module/package:\\n  - `auth`\\n  - `users`\\n  - `customers`\\n  - `events`\\n  - `venues`\\n  - `contracts`\\n  - `dashboard`\\n- [x] T蘯｡o API Health Check cﾆ｡ b蘯｣n.\\n- [x] T蘯｡o README hﾆｰ盻嬾g d蘯ｫn cﾃi ﾄ黛ｺｷt vﾃ ch蘯｡y Backend.\\n- [x] Ki盻ノ tra project build thﾃnh cﾃｴng b蘯ｱng Maven.\\n- [x] Vi蘯ｿt test cﾆ｡ b蘯｣n ki盻ノ tra Spring Boot kh盻殃 ﾄ黛ｻ冢g.\\n- [x] T蘯｡o branch `feature/backend-core`.\\n- [x] Push code lﾃｪn GitHub.\\n- [x] M盻・Pull Request t盻ｫ `feature/backend-core` vﾃo `develop`.\\n\\n## K蘯ｿt qu蘯｣ c蘯ｧn giao\\n\\n- Source code Backend trong `backend/`\\n- Spring Boot project ch蘯｡y thﾃnh cﾃｴng\\n- PostgreSQL configuration\\n- JPA/Hibernate configuration\\n- Flyway configuration\\n- Security/JWT skeleton\\n- Swagger/OpenAPI\\n- Health Check API\\n- README\\n- Basic tests\\n- Branch `feature/backend-core`\\n- Pull Request vﾃo `develop`\\n\\n**Ngﾆｰ盻拱 ph盻･ trﾃ｡ch:** Phﾃｺc (Backend Dev)\\n\\n**Quy ﾆｰ盻嫩:** Push t盻ｫ tﾃi kho蘯｣n GitHub cﾃ｡ nhﾃ｢n c盻ｧa Dev vﾃ m盻・PR ﾄ黛ｻ・PM review.\",\"labels\":[{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm2GQ\",\"name\":\"type: feature\",\"description\":\"Ch盻ｩc nﾄハg m盻嬖\",\"color\":\"0075ca\"},{\"id\":\"LA_kwDOUkznlc8AAAAC3Sm6NQ\",\"name\":\"owner: phuc\",\"